Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.59,1:43:50.80,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}eki no hoomu kawara no michi
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.59,1:43:50.80,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Look beyond the railway platform, the path by the river
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.80,1:43:57.97,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}hanaretetemo onaji sora miagete
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.80,1:43:57.97,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}We can look up at the same sky even if we're apart
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.97,1:44:04.26,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}yunizon de utaou
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.97,1:44:04.26,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}And sing in unison!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.94,1:44:15.79,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}demo ne aeta yo suteki na tenshi ni
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.94,1:44:15.79,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}But we did meet a wonderful angel
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.79,1:44:19.91,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}sotsugyou wa owari ja nai
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.79,1:44:19.91,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Graduation isn't the end
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.91,1:44:24.33,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}kore kara mo nakama dakara
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.91,1:44:24.33,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}We'll remain friends forever
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.33,1:44:28.03,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}daisuki tte iu nara
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.33,1:44:28.03,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}If you say you really love us
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.03,1:44:32.05,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}daidaisuki tte kaesu yo
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.03,1:44:32.05,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}We'll answer that we really, really love you!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.05,1:44:36.31,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}wasuremono mou nai yo ne
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.05,1:44:36.31,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}We didn't forget anything, did we?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.31,1:44:42.83,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}zutto eien ni issho da yo
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.31,1:44:42.83,tensh,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}We'll be together forever and ever
