Dialogue: 10,0:01:23.84,0:01:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning already?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.14,0:02:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the club room.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.24,0:02:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.26,0:02:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.46,0:02:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sky high!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.44,0:02:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.08,0:02:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Afterschool Tea Time...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.78,0:02:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,can't play this kind of music!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.79,0:02:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I really want to keep playing this genre.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.96,0:02:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.54,0:02:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.32,0:02:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.88,0:02:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.39,0:02:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.87,0:02:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.37,0:02:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.84,0:02:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.05,0:02:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Stop...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.42,0:02:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.00,0:02:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.00,0:02:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Both of you!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.88,0:02:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.74,0:02:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.84,0:03:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.61,0:03:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.29,0:03:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Our light music club...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.17,0:03:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,might have to disband.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.52,0:03:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Disband?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.78,0:03:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why now?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.58,0:03:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone has different goals now.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.45,0:03:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's what people call "a conflict in musical taste,"
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.54,0:03:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Azu-nyan.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.53,0:03:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,As if you could call it that!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.34,0:03:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to hear a plebeian like you talking about taste.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.61,0:03:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You tripped and showed your panties to everyone!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.78,0:03:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Tha{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.65,0:03:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.44,0:03:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.41,0:03:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you talking about taste in music?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.28,0:03:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Azusa-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.16,0:03:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.32,0:03:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Afterschool Tea Time should do cheerful and upbeat{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.78,0:03:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I think...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.76,0:03:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.01,0:03:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,of this light, girly music!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.09,0:03:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even say that!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.30,0:03:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were one card short of a deck when you walked into this room and asked,{I thought the cards were stacked against me- would also work. Needs to be a card reference.}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.97,0:03:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,"Does the light music club play light music?"
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.80,0:03:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Cards...?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.37,0:03:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0} said I could just come in and laze around!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.42,0:04:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we play cards?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.07,0:04:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid, Azusa?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.83,0:04:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're talking about the very future of our light music club!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.34,0:04:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Azu-nyan...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.30,0:04:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.48,0:04:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.44,0:04:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,later.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.51,0:04:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.50,0:04:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My God!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.66,0:04:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You joined the club,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.78,0:04:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and you couldn't play guitar,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.76,0:04:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,you couldn't even play harmonica...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.08,0:04:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.78,0:04:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can pway hahmonica!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.68,0:04:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.61,0:04:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.66,0:04:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I lied.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.33,0:04:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going loony!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.68,0:04:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mugi-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.59,0:04:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mugi...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.51,0:04:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all because you bring snacks, you know!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.07,0:04:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're{\i0} the one eating all the time!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.97,0:04:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I only do that because she brings yummy snacks!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.07,0:04:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm {\i1}so{\i0} sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.81,0:04:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you just say?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.90,0:04:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell her a thing or two, Mio-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.47,0:04:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.29,0:04:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Ritsu's fault!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.05,0:04:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.89,0:04:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You suck!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.15,0:04:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, punk?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.62,0:04:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this the song that you were...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.57,0:05:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you doing...?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.72,0:05:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You figured it out?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.45,0:05:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We were pretending to be Death Devil.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.14,0:05:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It was so fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.69,0:05:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we stop doing these weird acts during rehearsals?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.42,0:05:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But you were totally into it!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.35,0:05:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It was an act?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.70,0:05:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.32,0:05:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't a conflict in the band...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.06,0:05:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,seem really interesting?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.63,0:05:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bound to happen in a band.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.16,0:05:30.40,Default,,1000,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.16,0:05:30.40,Default,,0,1000,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.16,0:05:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.16,0:05:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we have you here...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.37,0:05:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,One second, please.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.40,0:05:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a snack!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.78,0:05:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.96,0:05:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.86,0:07:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's reflect on our performance just now.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.96,0:07:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Azu-nyan would be a bit more surprised.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.74,0:07:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a reflection on your playing, is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.60,0:07:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I already fed Ton-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.90,0:07:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.12,0:07:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone was mediocre.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.76,0:07:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think you should've said "you're going loony."
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.01,0:07:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.63,0:07:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell {\i1}us{\i0} that.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.81,0:07:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought this club could become so unenthusiastic.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.61,0:08:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and {\i1}you're{\i0} the image of perfection.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.71,0:08:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't joined...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.54,0:08:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,you might have never had the chance to drink that tea.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.37,0:08:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the Kotobuki family's prized tea!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.02,0:08:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. It's very good.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.83,0:08:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You brought {\i1}Baumkuchen{\i0}?{cake made of concentric circular layers of sponge}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.58,0:08:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's peel each layer off!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.64,0:08:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.50,0:08:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds painful...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.55,0:08:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Mugi!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.58,0:08:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so hard to open...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.41,0:08:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We've been eating snacks,{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.78,0:08:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}drinking tea,{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.87,0:08:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and rehearsing together for three years...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.88,0:08:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,...all we have left to do is graduate!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.82,0:08:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.35,0:08:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,do you really want to sit around doing nothing?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.89,0:08:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already been accepted into college, though!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.53,0:08:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Ricchan?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.05,0:08:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.68,0:08:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Mugi-senpai and Mio-senpai don't surprise me.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.21,0:08:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.17,0:08:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mugi-senpai, I have some scissors.{something came before senpai. check please}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.17,0:08:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What'd that kid just say?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.73,0:08:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui-senpai...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.72,0:08:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it cute?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.22,0:08:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.58,0:09:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, then!{lolidk}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.64,0:09:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad we all got into the same college.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.77,0:09:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a toast!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.29,0:09:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, Azu-nyan!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.70,0:09:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.42,0:09:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.13,0:09:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.13,0:09:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sawa-chan?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.05,0:09:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really relieved, you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.75,0:09:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You all successfully made it into college.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.42,0:09:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Being a homeroom teacher for a senior class must be hard.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.52,0:09:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It all went by so quickly, didn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.11,0:09:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already time for you guys to graduate.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.16,0:09:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how much tea we drank in the past three years.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.29,0:09:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably more than a thousand cups.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.61,0:09:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,One thousand!{She said it in English... time to change to latin ( ﾟ∀ﾟ)ｱﾊﾊ八八ﾉヽﾉヽﾉヽﾉ ＼ / ＼/ ＼}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.85,0:09:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We're definitely Afterschool Tea Time.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.99,0:09:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We're doing exactly what the band name suggests.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.67,0:09:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.52,0:09:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,all we have to do is send you off...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.52,0:09:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as you don't get held back.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.37,0:09:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Held back...?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.31,0:10:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a meeting next week,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.98,0:10:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and we're going to see if you've attended enough days...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.71,0:10:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,or if you've had too many bad marks.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.14,0:10:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's {\i1}that{\i0} important?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.41,0:10:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,S-S-S-Sawa-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.84,0:10:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We were just imitating Death Devil!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.97,0:10:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All hail Death Devil!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.57,0:10:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Your band is the best!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.73,0:10:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So please{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.77,0:10:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.77,0:10:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't help us out, we might be in...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.41,0:10:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,...Dire Straits!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.72,0:10:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She just referenced an 80's band...{Feel free to be creative. Ricchan just said 「よろしく」 in Kanji (as 「夜露死苦」), which is sometimes considered a type of yankii/yakuza/slang lingo.}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.00,0:10:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Jokes aren't going to save you!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.80,0:10:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty please!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.74,0:10:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamanaka Sawako, my beloved mentor!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.24,0:10:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.17,0:10:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.58,0:10:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.67,0:10:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.50,0:10:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it about Sawa-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.19,0:10:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.73,0:10:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.34,0:11:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is definitely one of theirs...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.89,0:11:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We might not have been able to prove ourselves as upperclassmen.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.10,0:11:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.10,0:11:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.68,0:11:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, we have!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.21,0:11:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We're...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.49,0:11:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Taller!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.58,0:11:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Older!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.66,0:11:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,More lively!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.20,0:11:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything better?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.61,0:11:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.55,0:11:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,want to do something an upperclassman would do!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.94,0:11:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.86,0:11:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it, Yui!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.91,0:11:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Great idea!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.06,0:11:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.99,0:11:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We should give her a present.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.30,0:11:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Something that fits Azu-nyan's personality.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.19,0:11:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.46,0:11:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so excited.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.42,0:11:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to keep this a secret.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.14,0:11:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.72,0:11:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Azu-nyan?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.26,0:11:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been littering everywhere.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.49,0:12:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we might get lost on the way back...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.49,0:12:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I picked them all up.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.72,0:12:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never be able to find my way back now...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.92,0:12:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure you will.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.52,0:12:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.73,0:12:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.23,0:12:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Something that Azusa-chan would like?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.54,0:12:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.57,0:12:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It can be anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.30,0:12:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.52,0:12:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Has she said anything to you?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.91,0:12:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She's in your class, so...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.39,0:12:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Has she said, "My upperclassmen are so awesome!" or anything like that?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.21,0:12:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.74,0:12:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.71,0:12:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she wanted you guys to take practice {\i1}a bit{\i0} more seriously,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.43,0:12:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and keep the room just {\i1}a bit{\i0} cleaner,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.12,0:12:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and cut back on the hugging.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.96,0:12:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Onee-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.08,0:13:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing out of the ordinary.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.14,0:13:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised Azu-nyan stayed in the club for so long.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.45,0:13:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.87,0:13:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Azusa-chan always talks about you!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.39,0:13:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.48,0:13:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Really!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.56,0:13:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, Azusa-chan joined the light music club
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.16,0:13:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,because she heard you guys playing.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.94,0:13:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.26,0:13:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.17,0:13:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you graduate with her, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.84,0:13:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.05,0:13:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I was kidding, Onee-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.10,0:13:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Azu-nyan...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.25,0:14:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.04,0:14:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.01,0:14:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning, Mugi-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.17,0:14:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Gitah-chan left some marks on your face.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.28,0:14:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I slept with him last night.{uh... yeah.}{ehehehe}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.17,0:14:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so cold!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.62,0:14:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I hold your hand?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.43,0:14:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.94,0:14:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ritsu, Ritsu!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.92,0:14:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.66,0:14:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wrote some new lyrics last night before I went to bed.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.52,0:14:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a new song?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.05,0:14:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice-Creamy Love...{said "Guy" originally, but doesn't she say "ai"? I feel "love" is more appropriate because we know they're all lesbians and men don't exist}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.14,0:14:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get Mugi to write the music!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.89,0:14:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ricchan! Mio-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.40,0:14:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.60,0:14:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.14,0:14:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I got sweaty because your hands were so warm, Mugi-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.01,0:14:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My hands are frozen because yours are so cold, Akiyama-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.57,0:15:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.68,0:15:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think of anything to give to Azu-nyan?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.07,0:15:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.90,0:15:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell asleep while I was thinking.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.40,0:15:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.53,0:15:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even take my socks off.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.82,0:15:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I take mine off before I get into bed.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.45,0:15:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.60,0:15:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so lewd, Mio-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.61,0:15:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just socks!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.45,0:15:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We should make reservations as early as possible.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.75,0:15:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.62,0:15:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're early today.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.97,0:15:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.97,0:15:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have many other opportunities to meet.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.69,0:15:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.21,0:15:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Nodoka-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.59,0:15:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.47,0:15:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to make reservations tomorrow, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.76,0:15:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We can go swimsuit shopping afterwards.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.92,0:15:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been to Hawaii before!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.67,0:15:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They're talking about Hawaii,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.11,0:15:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mugi-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.15,0:15:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.36,0:15:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you going to Hawaii?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.77,0:15:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.40,0:15:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,For our graduation trip.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.12,0:15:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the light music club?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.36,0:15:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going anywhere?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.73,0:15:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ricchan!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.72,0:15:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What'cha want?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.81,0:15:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}When we get guidebooks,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.10,0:15:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The volleyball team is going on a graduation trip.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.10,0:15:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}we should each get one, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.88,0:15:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.97,0:15:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.08,0:15:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,When are you guys going?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.00,0:16:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A week before graduation.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.00,0:16:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cheaper around that time.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.92,0:16:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear that, Ricchan?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.33,0:16:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be because it's before spring break.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.52,0:16:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we go too?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.26,0:16:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.41,0:16:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They do what they do,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.50,0:16:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and we do what we do!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.50,0:16:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.50,0:16:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.11,0:16:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, we need to think of something for Azusa first.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.48,0:16:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I have your attention, everyone?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.12,0:16:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to do something for\N Sawako-sensei at the graduation ceremony.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.70,0:16:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Any ideas?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.96,0:16:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll keep this a secret, of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.88,0:16:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.14,0:16:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we make her cry?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.21,0:16:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We could all sing the school song!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.72,0:16:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What does Sawako-sensei like?{school theme, heavy metal arrangement. HERE WE GO}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.12,0:16:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.53,0:16:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And so...!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.21,0:16:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we should go on a graduation trip!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.58,0:16:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This again...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.90,0:16:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, we all got our passports!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.84,0:16:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't we supposed to think of something for Azusa first?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.17,0:16:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure we will, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.71,0:16:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.31,0:17:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You always leave everything until the last minute.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.86,0:17:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.08,0:17:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so uptight!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.48,0:17:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I interviewed Ui.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.76,0:17:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.48,0:17:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.48,0:17:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ui said...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.14,0:17:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.09,0:17:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.05,0:17:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Animal caricatures!{Literally "Caricatures of Animals," a national treasure that illustrates animals and their lifestyle. Sometimes considered the very origin of manga.}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.06,0:17:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I was looking through my textbook the other{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.09,0:17:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what about Ui-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.79,0:17:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.72,0:17:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ui said...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.04,0:17:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe we could stay in school for another year,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.14,0:17:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and graduate with Azu-nyan.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.02,0:17:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to repeat a year as a {\i1}gift?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.66,0:17:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.14,0:17:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll repeat a year!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.10,0:17:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.69,0:17:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.27,0:17:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.20,0:17:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're definitely hiding something.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.85,0:17:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.19,0:17:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.24,0:17:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,were you talking about repeating a year?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.77,0:17:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We all have our own problems...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.48,0:17:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How much did you hear, Azusa-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.74,0:17:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't on purpose,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.26,0:17:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I just happened to overhear.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.96,0:17:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You just misheard it...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.02,0:17:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.72,0:17:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Misheard it...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.59,0:17:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Misheard it...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.09,0:18:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.40,0:18:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We were just talking about where to go for our graduation trip!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.44,0:18:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Federal Republic of Germany has a city called Lünen!{Lünen sounds like ryu-nen, which is "repeat a year"}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.44,0:18:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTahoma\fs54}Lünen sounds like ryuunen, which is "repeat a year"
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.58,0:18:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.09,0:18:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What an unfortunate name...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.80,0:18:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't go there!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.25,0:18:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a graduation trip?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.72,0:18:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Dubai!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.65,0:18:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you want to go to Hawaii?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.04,0:18:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Dubah!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.33,0:18:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Europe!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.94,0:18:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot springs!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.17,0:18:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to play ping pong!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.11,0:18:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you, Mio-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.61,0:18:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.02,0:18:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,London.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.82,0:18:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of musicians are from London,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.38,0:18:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's rich in musical history.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.95,0:18:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all over the globe.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.72,0:18:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.22,0:18:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not graduating yet,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.82,0:18:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,so I don't have a preference.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.91,0:18:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,When did we even decide to go?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.27,0:18:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It just kinda happened.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.42,0:19:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.53,0:19:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.56,0:19:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to go, Mio-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.54,0:19:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I do, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.20,0:19:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.25,0:19:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,who {\i1}doesn't{\i0} want to go on a graduation trip?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.41,0:19:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.78,0:19:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ton-chan.{or some finishing percussion line; badum-tss seems kinda too humorous for this...}{bope, says ton-chan}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.10,0:19:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's decided!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.13,0:19:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What a simple way to decide things.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.81,0:19:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.03,0:19:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we draw lotteries to decide where to go?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.14,0:19:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty good at those things!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.72,0:19:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly does that mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.72,0:19:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Done!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.65,0:19:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tainaka Ritsu-san, our leader!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.12,0:19:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.85,0:19:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.82,0:19:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.93,0:19:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This one!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.46,0:19:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.46,0:19:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder where it'll lead?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.06,0:19:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.09,0:19:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been decided!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.81,0:19:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Europe!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.92,0:19:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right, Yui-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:00.46,0:20:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where exactly in Europe are we going?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.08,0:20:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask Yui.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.50,0:20:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui-senpai.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.72,0:20:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.20,0:20:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I have a look at that paper?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.33,0:20:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.21,0:20:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.29,0:20:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just... curious.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.32,0:20:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.06,0:20:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,She's running away!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.29,0:20:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She fell!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.90,0:20:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.44,0:20:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.94,0:20:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.37,0:20:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.62,0:20:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ric...chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.70,0:20:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.90,0:20:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I... finally did it...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.67,0:20:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This hand...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.39,0:20:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.53,0:20:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You finally did it, Yui!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.58,0:20:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ricchan...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.88,0:20:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.78,0:20:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She cheated.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.79,0:20:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.15,0:20:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.35,0:20:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too obvious.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.22,0:20:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you cheat?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.96,0:21:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impressive, Yui-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.68,0:21:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not praising you.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.00,0:21:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I've made a mistake...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.49,0:21:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay like that for a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.60,0:21:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.50,0:21:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we decide for real this time?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.27,0:21:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,None of us want to go to the same place, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.89,0:21:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What about a vote?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.47,0:21:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't work.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.07,0:21:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we let Ton-chan decide?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.79,0:21:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a rest.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.84,0:21:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Which teacup will Ton-chan choose?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:39.04,0:21:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like he's in an amusement park!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.82,0:21:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:43.40,0:21:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.18,0:21:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I think the cup for Europe is a bit small...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:47.68,0:21:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you get for cheating.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:49.98,0:21:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.02,0:21:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I never thought Ton-chan would have to take on so much responsibility...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:59.88,0:22:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ton-chan seems to be...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:02.56,0:22:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,focused on the upper half of the tank.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.06,0:22:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He has no interest in the teacups.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:11.88,0:22:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice weather, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:14.87,0:22:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're bored with it already!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:19.75,0:22:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,T-T-Ton-chan is...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:22.04,0:22:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,heading toward Europe!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:24.75,0:22:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's touching London, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:26.34,0:22:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:27.92,0:22:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:29.11,0:22:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,are we going to London?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:30.53,0:22:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:31.06,0:22:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:33.62,0:22:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,London is part of Europe, so it's fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:36.25,0:22:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It is?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:37.73,0:22:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just exactly how big {\i1}is{\i0} Europe?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:40.89,0:22:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I pity the college you're entering.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:44.62,0:22:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:45.81,0:22:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He chose London!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:47.50,0:22:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that great, Mio-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:50.45,0:22:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:52.71,0:22:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio?!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:54.14,0:22:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:55.36,0:22:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,London!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:56.40,0:22:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:57.90,0:23:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down already...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:01.54,0:23:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Lo-Lo{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:23:02.37,0:23:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,London!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:04.74,0:23:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,She must've {\i1}really{\i0} wanted to go.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:08.81,0:23:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We can have afternoon tea!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:12.21,0:23:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have tea in London?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:14.20,0:23:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the tea capital, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:16.31,0:23:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:17.46,0:23:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's perfect for us!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:20.37,0:23:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We might need two rooms for the five of us.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:23.57,0:23:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Three and two?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:24.79,0:23:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:25.59,0:23:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Five?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:26.55,0:23:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going too, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:28.66,0:23:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:29.59,0:23:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's {\i1}your{\i0} graduation trip!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:31.96,0:23:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you lose your passport?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:33.68,0:23:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:35.08,0:23:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have school...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:36.82,0:23:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a break after exams.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:39.89,0:23:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We {\i1}do{\i0} have five days off...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.41,0:23:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem, then!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:44.32,0:23:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.81,0:23:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to come, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:47.72,0:23:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're part of the light music club!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:54.16,0:23:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Azusa,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:55.50,0:23:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,do you not want to go?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:57.16,0:23:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I do!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:58.72,0:23:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:00.41,0:24:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,are you sure I won't ruin your trip?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:02.98,0:24:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:07.48,0:24:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:08.87,0:24:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:10.23,0:24:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,To London!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:11.68,0:24:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you get excited,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:13.14,0:24:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to check with my family.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:18.63,0:24:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:19.21,0:24:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:20.44,0:24:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:22.17,0:24:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:23.27,0:24:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Um{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:24:28.86,0:24:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mom!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:37.33,0:24:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom gave me permission, so{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:24:39.97,0:24:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, London.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:41.74,0:24:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:42.47,0:24:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a graduation trip.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:44.61,0:24:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mom?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:46.06,0:24:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, Mom!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:48.56,0:24:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:49.53,0:24:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ritsu will be there, so I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:49.85,0:24:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:51.92,0:24:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:52.97,0:24:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:52.97,0:24:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:59.40,0:25:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to look out for them.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:03.83,0:25:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:05.00,0:25:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually meant...
Dialogue: 10,0:25:06.24,0:25:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the{\i0} London?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:09.09,0:25:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:10.79,0:25:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What other Londons are there, Nodoka-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:15.73,0:25:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You randomly sent me a text,
Dialogue: 10,0:25:17.51,0:25:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,so I thought it was a new restaurant or something.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:20.39,0:25:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to get reservations at a travel agency tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:24.41,0:25:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know
Dialogue: 10,0:25:25.99,0:25:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,that the light music club wanted to go to England so badly.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:32.69,0:25:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem different.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:34.95,0:25:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio-chan was the one who wanted to go,
Dialogue: 10,0:25:38.25,0:25:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and Ton-chan decided where to go.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:40.37,0:25:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You let a softshell turtle decide?{soft shell?}
Dialogue: 10,0:25:42.04,0:25:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a pig-nosed turtle.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:43.99,0:25:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're going to London, not England.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:49.68,0:25:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui...
Dialogue: 10,0:25:50.73,0:25:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to put this, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:25:53.68,0:25:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,London's in England.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:57.76,0:25:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It was so sudden.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:59.68,0:26:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think I'd be going too.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:02.46,0:26:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're buying so many.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:05.25,0:26:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to do the research for them.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:12.40,0:26:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Look after my sister, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:14.52,0:26:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ui...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:16.36,0:26:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,About your sister...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:19.36,0:26:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like she's hiding something from me.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:23.97,0:26:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:26.72,0:26:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think my sister is even capable of keeping secrets.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:31.44,0:26:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:33.77,0:26:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:35.42,0:26:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to make a reservation?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:37.68,0:26:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:39.06,0:26:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd like to spend five days in London...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:42.08,0:26:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that five days and three nights?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:44.44,0:26:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Three?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:45.13,0:26:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that one short?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:46.90,0:26:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We spend one night traveling.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:48.85,0:26:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:49.76,0:26:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:50.31,0:26:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:51.01,0:26:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:51.64,0:26:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to travel to the city only?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:54.08,0:26:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:55.14,0:26:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:56.36,0:26:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be fine!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:57.64,0:26:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There's plenty to see.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:59.92,0:27:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna ride this!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:01.27,0:27:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's visit a tea store!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:02.70,0:27:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks delicious!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:04.84,0:27:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:05.40,0:27:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks cool!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:07.01,0:27:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I want to go to Jimmy Page and Jimmy Hendrix's houses!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:10.80,0:27:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds great!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:11.83,0:27:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,David Bowie's house is there, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:13.06,0:27:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, an instrument shop!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:14.48,0:27:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Abbey Road!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:15.37,0:27:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:27:16.66,0:27:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I would recommend a open trip in that case.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:21.64,0:27:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's too{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:27:23.60,0:27:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do that!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:41.57,0:27:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:44.23,0:27:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're from the light music club.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:45.62,0:27:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cold, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:47.96,0:27:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The occult club is still having activities?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:50.82,0:27:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:51.70,0:27:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to attempt to communicate with aliens on the roof.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:56.18,0:27:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:57.40,0:28:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The light music club is going to England!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:00.01,0:28:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:01.37,0:28:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a graduation trip!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:03.29,0:28:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want a souvenir?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:07.44,0:28:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The Loch Ness Monster...
Dialogue: 10,0:28:13.53,0:28:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The Loch Ness...
Dialogue: 10,0:28:16.17,0:28:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A picture of the Loch Ness Monster...
Dialogue: 10,0:28:19.03,0:28:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:21.08,0:28:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:24.63,0:28:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 10,0:28:26.61,0:28:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what they said.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:28.77,0:28:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we fit that into our agenda?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:31.27,0:28:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Loch Ness Monster?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:34.86,0:28:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Loch Ness is too far.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:37.64,0:28:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard the monster doesn't even exist.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:40.58,0:28:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:41.04,0:28:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that an occult club joke?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:43.62,0:28:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't understand their jokes!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:47.20,0:28:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, Hirasawa-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:49.12,0:28:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:49.98,0:28:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Does anyone else have a request?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:52.73,0:28:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:52.73,0:28:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:54.16,0:28:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll organize the itinerary, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:00.16,0:29:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need some help?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:01.62,0:29:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:02.58,0:29:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I like doing this type of thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:04.36,0:29:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:05.70,0:29:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want another cup, Azusa-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:07.74,0:29:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:09.42,0:29:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm stuffed.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:11.10,0:29:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have less snack time if Azu-nyan schedules our trip...
Dialogue: 10,0:29:16.00,0:29:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be allowed to be free if it's an open trip!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:20.21,0:29:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Azusa, are you going home?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:21.65,0:29:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:22.52,0:29:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you staying here?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:25.44,0:29:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going home{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:29:29.52,0:29:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,after I practice for afternoon tea.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:33.34,0:29:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We will...
Dialogue: 10,0:29:35.27,0:29:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,have another cup of tea!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:37.22,0:29:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this, Azusa-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:39.98,0:29:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the best we could do for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:41.58,0:29:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll wash your cup.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:43.53,0:29:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:44.85,0:29:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:46.07,0:29:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch yourself out there, Azusa!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:47.69,0:29:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Be sure to schedule in some snack time!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:49.36,0:29:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get going now.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:51.22,0:29:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:54.05,0:29:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 10,0:29:56.00,0:29:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the real...
Dialogue: 10,0:29:57.98,0:29:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,deal!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:59.50,0:30:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:00.46,0:30:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still here?
Dialogue: 10,0:30:01.50,0:30:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:02.86,0:30:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sawa-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:30:04.56,0:30:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This was the best we could do for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:06.25,0:30:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't you have a date today?
Dialogue: 10,0:30:09.67,0:30:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any plans!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:11.40,0:30:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:15.18,0:30:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:16.53,0:30:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What would Azu-nyan want...{NOTE: "It's the best we could do" (just a few lines back) fixed to "It's the best we could get you"}
Dialogue: 10,0:30:20.64,0:30:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,for her present?
Dialogue: 10,0:30:22.15,0:30:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,She's done so much for us.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:24.82,0:30:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how can return that favor in our own way...?
Dialogue: 10,0:30:30.60,0:30:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How about a play?
Dialogue: 10,0:30:31.50,0:30:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No more plays!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:32.66,0:30:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 10,0:30:35.50,0:30:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Azu-nyan forgot her Muttan!{...check this. I don't fucking know}
Dialogue: 10,0:30:38.04,0:30:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:39.60,0:30:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Mustang.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:41.74,0:30:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yours is Elizabeth, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:30:47.27,0:30:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we ask Muttan?
Dialogue: 10,0:30:50.53,0:30:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Muttan,
Dialogue: 10,0:30:52.96,0:30:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,what should we get for Azu-nyan?
Dialogue: 10,0:30:57.02,0:30:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:59.78,0:31:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Muttan!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:06.05,0:31:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Muttan said...
Dialogue: 10,0:31:08.71,0:31:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,a song.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:10.15,0:31:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:11.10,0:31:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,She hit her head!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:13.10,0:31:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A sarong?{( ¬‿¬)   jk, something else... thong... dong... bong... GANBARE AMANII}{you nearly killed me}
Dialogue: 10,0:31:14.10,0:31:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No, a song{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:31:15.83,0:31:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...stress?{ricchan just finished a word that began with "kyoku," or "song." songololo is a millipede.}
Dialogue: 10,0:31:16.87,0:31:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 10,0:31:18.28,0:31:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,a {\i1}song{\i0}{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:31:19.10,0:31:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...bird?
Dialogue: 10,0:31:20.04,0:31:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No, like a composition,
Dialogue: 10,0:31:21.93,0:31:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,or music...
Dialogue: 10,0:31:25.29,0:31:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I think of this earlier?
Dialogue: 10,0:31:28.23,0:31:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to dedicate a song to Azu-nyan?
Dialogue: 10,0:31:31.81,0:31:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:32.59,0:31:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ui told me
Dialogue: 10,0:31:34.64,0:31:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,that Azu-nyan loves the light music club
Dialogue: 10,0:31:37.89,0:31:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and{\i0} its music!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:41.42,0:31:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A song for Azusa-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:31:45.32,0:31:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's brilliant!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:46.94,0:31:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:47.85,0:31:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Her very own song!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:49.85,0:31:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's perfect!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:51.35,0:31:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:53.60,0:31:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yui,
Dialogue: 10,0:31:54.77,0:31:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,what kind of song should we write?
Dialogue: 10,0:31:57.48,0:32:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Her seniors are making it for her,
Dialogue: 10,0:32:00.22,0:32:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's gotta go like... boom!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:01.62,0:32:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And then some... blam!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:02.83,0:32:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And finish with a crash!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:05.61,0:32:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, totally.{ricchan directly said idk, but sarcasm may be appropriate here}
Dialogue: 10,0:32:06.86,0:32:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It just has to be way better than anything we've ever written before!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:15.04,0:32:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So... how do we do that?
Dialogue: 10,0:32:22.82,0:32:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot, I can't believe I forgot.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:24.81,0:32:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:27.53,0:32:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just... kidding.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:30.66,0:32:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Azu-nyan?!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:31.48,0:32:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:32:32.07,0:32:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Um{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:32:32.93,0:32:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I just got back.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:34.53,0:32:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:35.92,0:32:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:40.07,0:32:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close...
Dialogue: 10,0:32:41.80,0:32:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:43.45,0:32:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You left Muttan here!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:46.32,0:32:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget him again!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:49.02,0:32:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:51.21,0:32:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:52.86,0:32:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:02.94,0:33:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All clear.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:05.08,0:33:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Azu-nyan?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:06.17,0:33:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:09.17,0:33:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mind me.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:10.64,0:33:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:17.74,0:33:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've never seen them so serious before...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:33:28.36,0:33:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Something's fishy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:33:37.82,0:33:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Mugi.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:45.82,0:33:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like she's having fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:48.12,0:33:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really nervous.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:58.52,0:34:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get even better once we travel the world!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:07.67,0:34:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold this down, Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:12.16,0:34:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't fit!{HA.}
Dialogue: 10,0:34:14.02,0:34:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I packed tons of Japanese food!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:16.16,0:34:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You usually start missing it after a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:19.33,0:34:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're taking your uniform too, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:21.37,0:34:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else is, so yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:22.96,0:34:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:23.93,0:34:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui,
Dialogue: 10,0:34:25.17,0:34:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you should take this English guidebook with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:28.02,0:34:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:29.19,0:34:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget outlet converters and transformers.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:31.36,0:34:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:32.02,0:34:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure everything will fit...
Dialogue: 10,0:34:33.93,0:34:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you get enough sleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:35.34,0:34:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, Ui.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:36.37,0:34:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:36.37,0:34:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:40.39,0:34:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to London tomorrow...
Dialogue: 10,0:34:44.25,0:34:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:45.90,0:34:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd have nothing to worry about if you came.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:50.66,0:34:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You probably wouldn't fit...
Dialogue: 10,0:34:52.69,0:34:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:53.75,0:34:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Onee-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:55.46,0:34:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:58.46,0:35:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:01.64,0:35:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go get a drink.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:03.17,0:35:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:03.89,0:35:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep an eye on my stuff.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:05.22,0:35:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:11.32,0:35:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ricchan, Ricchan!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:13.06,0:35:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mornin'!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:14.65,0:35:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:16.64,0:35:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're bringing Gitah?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:17.62,0:35:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to take some pictures with him!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:21.09,0:35:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,First Mio, now you...
Dialogue: 10,0:35:22.60,0:35:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:23.43,0:35:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:24.30,0:35:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:25.43,0:35:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Azusa too...
Dialogue: 10,0:35:30.01,0:35:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:31.33,0:35:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:33.82,0:35:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You brought your Mustang, too?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:35.75,0:35:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:36.84,0:35:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure about everyone,
Dialogue: 10,0:35:38.24,0:35:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but I knew Yui-senpai would definitely bring her guitar.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:41.81,0:35:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Told you so!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:42.87,0:35:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui, Azusa, you're both here.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:46.12,0:35:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so...
Dialogue: 10,0:35:47.85,0:35:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We might have some famous musicians sign them while we're there!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:51.69,0:35:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:53.34,0:35:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head to Mugi's station now.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:00.55,0:36:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ricchan has her drumsticks!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:03.27,0:36:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't forget anything, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:05.67,0:36:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot my passport!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:08.05,0:36:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll leave Yui-senpai here, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:10.01,0:36:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:36:10.88,0:36:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hanging from your neck.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:14.67,0:36:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I just felt like freaking you out.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:31.54,0:36:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning, Mugi-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:33.39,0:36:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:35.26,0:36:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:36.17,0:36:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I should've brought my keyboard too!{yeah, a 20+kg keyboard. sure.}
Dialogue: 10,0:36:44.48,0:36:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:45.40,0:36:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge...
Dialogue: 10,0:36:46.60,0:36:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have some tea...
Dialogue: 10,0:36:48.20,0:36:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:49.77,0:36:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's check our bags in first.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:51.66,0:36:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:54.71,0:36:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We're very sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:56.93,0:37:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This flight is very crowded,{she said "very crowded," but let's go with implications here}{it actually makes it harder to understand this way, so back to "very crowded"}
Dialogue: 10,0:37:00.10,0:37:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,so you won't be able to bring those as carry ons.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:08.47,0:37:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you in London, Gitah!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:11.21,0:37:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This is cool.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:12.23,0:37:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We should have one at school!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:14.26,0:37:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,People walkers are awesome!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:15.75,0:37:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a people {\i1}mover{\i0}.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:18.04,0:37:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see your legs!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:20.37,0:37:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on between you and that guy?!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:22.52,0:37:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you two dating?!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:24.24,0:37:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us, Kotobuki-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:29.20,0:37:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Moonwalk, moonwalk...
Dialogue: 10,0:37:31.68,0:37:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They're having way too much fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:33.90,0:37:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:35.88,0:37:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 10,0:37:44.30,0:37:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ritsu, Ritsu!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:45.12,0:37:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I buy some snacks?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:46.61,0:37:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be served a meal as soon as we board.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:48.71,0:37:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure know a lot about travel.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:50.68,0:37:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I did some research.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:55.67,0:37:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:58.29,0:38:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be in London when we get off the plane.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:01.88,0:38:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a totally different country!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:04.36,0:38:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought we'd be going overseas together!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:07.48,0:38:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We might even end up time traveling!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:10.41,0:38:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a time machine.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:13.56,0:38:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But time {\i1}will{\i0} move backward.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:15.16,0:38:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mugi-senpai!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:18.44,0:38:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, have a sleeping mask.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:20.34,0:38:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:21.32,0:38:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:22.78,0:38:23.85,Default,,500,0,0,,Hey, Mugi,
Dialogue: 10,0:38:23.20,0:38:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What did she mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:23.85,0:38:25.18,Default,,500,0,0,,how do I use this?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:25.18,0:38:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I think it's because we're changing time zones.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:25.18,0:38:27.02,Default,,500,0,0,,You just have to press here, and...
Dialogue: 10,0:38:27.02,0:38:28.47,Default,,500,0,0,,see?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:28.87,0:38:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You go back in time when you change time zones?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:31.60,0:38:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:32.58,0:38:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then{\fscx200}-{if we keep going, can I see dinosaurs?}
Dialogue: 10,0:38:35.97,0:38:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Put your seatbelt on, Senpai.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:41.01,0:38:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So, if we went through enough different time zones,
Dialogue: 10,0:38:43.40,0:38:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,how far back would we end up?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:45.17,0:38:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't go that far.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:47.53,0:38:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How far{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:38:49.11,0:38:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking off!{yeah, right. taxiing takes forever...}
Dialogue: 10,0:38:51.17,0:38:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it liftoff?!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:52.86,0:38:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Azu-nyan, we're moving!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:05.27,0:39:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Clouds!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:15.37,0:39:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No Japanese from here on, Azu-nyan!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:18.38,0:39:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:19.43,0:39:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:22.64,0:39:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,...I understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:25.30,0:39:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Azu-cat.{LOL}{NYAN=CAT}
Dialogue: 10,0:39:26.82,0:39:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:28.50,0:39:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No Japanese!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:32.96,0:39:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Azu-cat, what's "in-flight meal" in English?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:35.70,0:39:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,"Flight meal."
Dialogue: 10,0:39:37.16,0:39:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Chicken or beef?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:40.47,0:39:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Exercise!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:43.36,0:39:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Chicken, please.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:45.34,0:39:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:47.42,0:39:48.62,Default,,0,800,0,,And me?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:48.62,0:39:49.25,Default,,0,800,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:49.86,0:39:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:49.86,0:39:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Chicken or beef?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:52.36,0:39:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Beef, please.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:53.88,0:39:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:55.18,0:39:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:56.07,0:39:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:56.68,0:39:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like the Japanese meal or the Western meal?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:26.71,0:40:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Azu-nyan!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:27.49,0:40:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Azu-nyan!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:36.38,0:40:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 10,0:40:37.52,0:40:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I should think of lyrics for Azu-nyan's song.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:01.16,0:41:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There... you... go!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:12.42,0:41:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this...?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:14.60,0:41:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,"Worldwide?"
Dialogue: 10,0:41:21.01,0:41:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see anything, Azu-nyan?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:23.35,0:41:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:23.83,0:41:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:41:24.40,0:41:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:28.80,0:41:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:29.66,0:41:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Were you writing something down?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:32.31,0:41:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:33.67,0:41:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,About my future.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:37.14,0:41:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I have lots of concerns.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:58.36,0:41:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:42:00.23,0:42:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It seems too late,{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:42:02.58,0:42:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but are they really trying to change the band's style?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:42:06.69,0:42:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or even worse,{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:42:07.92,0:42:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}maybe she has to repeat a year and is {\i0}seriously{\i1} concerned about her future!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:42:12.80,0:42:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If she becomes a hardcore,{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:42:14.42,0:42:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}brutish outlaw...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:42:23.22,0:42:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Azu-nyan!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:25.98,0:42:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:38.63,0:42:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,England?!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:39.54,0:42:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're already in England?!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:43.76,0:42:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That was faster than I thought.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:45.68,0:42:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my God!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:47.00,0:42:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're foreign!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:48.10,0:42:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We flew through the air!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:49.41,0:42:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Senpai!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:51.03,0:42:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We're really here...
Dialogue: 10,0:42:52.50,0:42:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is immigration next?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:54.12,0:42:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:55.26,0:42:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They usually ask for the purpose of our trip.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:59.02,0:43:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Our purpose, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:00.86,0:43:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 10,0:43:01.44,0:43:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,so we can go with "sightseeing."
Dialogue: 10,0:43:04.44,0:43:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:06.17,0:43:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Side business!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:07.66,0:43:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Side business?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:09.00,0:43:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:10.09,0:43:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:11.43,0:43:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Four days.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:13.53,0:43:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am seventeen.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:22.02,0:43:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been reunited!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:24.06,0:43:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm relieved now.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:25.33,0:43:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, why did we bring them in the first place?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:29.12,0:43:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:30.08,0:43:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get your stuff?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:31.35,0:43:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:32.81,0:43:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:33.89,0:43:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be here soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:39.19,0:43:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:40.15,0:43:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't show up...
Dialogue: 10,0:43:42.10,0:43:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is mine the only one gone?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:44.41,0:43:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they lost it.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:46.39,0:43:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you gonna do about your panties,
Dialogue: 10,0:43:48.90,0:43:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Akiyama?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:50.42,0:43:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio-chan doesn't wear any, right?{wat.     ｷﾀ━━━━(ﾟ∀ﾟ)━━━━!!}
Dialogue: 10,0:43:52.58,0:43:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:53.60,0:43:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She is no-panties!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:55.00,0:43:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Socks{\i0} are what I don't wear when I'm in {\i1}bed!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:43:58.23,0:43:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:59.65,0:44:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:01.64,0:44:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe someone took it off.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:03.93,0:44:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's always darkest beneath the lighthouse.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:05.82,0:44:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, at least it's here.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:05.82,0:44:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm so relieved...
Dialogue: 10,0:44:09.46,0:44:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so cold!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:10.43,0:44:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is London...
Dialogue: 10,0:44:13.80,0:44:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the London sky!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:15.77,0:44:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,London taxis!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:18.42,0:44:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,London English!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:20.19,0:44:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,London us!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:23.49,0:44:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys...
Dialogue: 10,0:44:25.24,0:44:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Taxi, taxi!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:26.76,0:44:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:28.14,0:44:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:29.21,0:44:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad told me that you have to open the taxi doors yourself in London...
Dialogue: 10,0:44:34.72,0:44:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:36.39,0:44:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no handle...?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:37.58,0:44:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably automatic.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:39.88,0:44:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you ask{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:44:43.72,0:44:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, that side!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:46.00,0:44:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, put your luggage up here, in front.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:47.73,0:44:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:50.09,0:44:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Where're you going?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:51.42,0:44:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We are, um...
Dialogue: 10,0:44:52.81,0:44:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hotel Ibis, please!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:54.72,0:44:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the Ibis?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:55.94,0:44:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:57.22,0:44:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He's asking where it is.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:59.59,0:45:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,In London, of course!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:02.20,0:45:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 10,0:45:03.24,0:45:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we just make a London joke?
Dialogue: 10,0:45:04.76,0:45:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,London City?
Dialogue: 10,0:45:06.16,0:45:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:07.81,0:45:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all backwards!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:09.30,0:45:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This feels weird!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:12.97,0:45:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Senpai?!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:15.05,0:45:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Yui!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:16.29,0:45:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I closed the door too suddenly.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:18.37,0:45:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{Omanko... tastes good...}I'm fine, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:20.18,0:45:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing I landed on something soft.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:22.81,0:45:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:24.47,0:45:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, what a surprise.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:27.02,0:45:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my line.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:29.75,0:45:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't Japan, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:44.21,0:45:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,London!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:45.36,0:45:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,London!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:51.18,0:45:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:54.45,0:45:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Being backwards was...
Dialogue: 10,0:45:55.85,0:45:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,a little tough...
Dialogue: 10,0:45:58.15,0:45:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Yui-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:45:59.84,0:46:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm alright...
Dialogue: 10,0:46:02.05,0:46:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I sit for a bit, though?
Dialogue: 10,0:46:06.26,0:46:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:46:08.39,0:46:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we have for dinner?
Dialogue: 10,0:46:10.58,0:46:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinner?!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:11.89,0:46:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I want roast beef.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:14.54,0:46:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice cream, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:16.85,0:46:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:18.52,0:46:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:46:20.30,0:46:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't have a reservation for the hotel.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:23.02,0:46:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So we can't stay?
Dialogue: 10,0:46:24.87,0:46:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we going to sleep on the streets?!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:26.37,0:46:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:26.99,0:46:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no...
Dialogue: 10,0:46:28.44,0:46:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,May I see that?
Dialogue: 10,0:46:30.30,0:46:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:35.80,0:46:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You've reserved the Ibis Earl's Court.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:39.33,0:46:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Earl's Court?
Dialogue: 10,0:46:41.27,0:46:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:42.14,0:46:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Ibis London City.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:44.46,0:46:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We have many locations throughout London.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:46.94,0:46:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What did she say, Mugi-senpai?
Dialogue: 10,0:46:49.48,0:46:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She's too fast...
Dialogue: 10,0:46:50.26,0:46:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:51.68,0:46:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She said there are a few of these hotels in the city.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:54.64,0:46:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:46:56.06,0:47:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Our reservation is at Earl's Court.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:00.63,0:47:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank God!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:02.98,0:47:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:04.01,0:47:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you desu!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:04.77,0:47:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:06.12,0:47:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a nice day!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:09.64,0:47:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Earl's Court...
Dialogue: 10,0:47:11.25,0:47:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Found it!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:12.05,0:47:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's here.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:13.57,0:47:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We're right here, so...
Dialogue: 10,0:47:15.61,0:47:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite a ways away.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:17.70,0:47:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we take a taxi again?
Dialogue: 10,0:47:19.16,0:47:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We can see Yui fly again!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:21.48,0:47:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to try sitting on the other side!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:23.65,0:47:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't we take a bus?
Dialogue: 10,0:47:26.57,0:47:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:28.07,0:47:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:47:30.41,0:47:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you figure it out, Mio-senpai?
Dialogue: 10,0:47:32.54,0:47:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be able to take the bus directly there.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:35.29,0:47:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:36.90,0:47:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We can take the subway straight to Earl's Court!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:41.73,0:47:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Azu-nyan?
Dialogue: 10,0:47:43.76,0:47:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:47:45.19,0:47:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought new shoes, so...
Dialogue: 10,0:47:48.01,0:47:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your feet hurt?
Dialogue: 10,0:47:50.08,0:47:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,A little.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:50.93,0:47:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get a blister?
Dialogue: 10,0:47:52.20,0:47:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Have they been hurting this whole time?
Dialogue: 10,0:47:53.93,0:47:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it just started.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:57.96,0:48:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we buy more comfortable shoes, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:48:01.10,0:48:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:01.74,0:48:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You all must be tired.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:03.60,0:48:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have our luggage, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:05.30,0:48:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go here, anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:07.21,0:48:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 10,0:48:08.42,0:48:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:09.20,0:48:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,They have rock apparel.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:11.33,0:48:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:12.50,0:48:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sound good, Azusa?
Dialogue: 10,0:48:29.45,0:48:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Azu-nyan, we've moving!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:37.91,0:48:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They look so cool!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:40.73,0:48:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to take a picture with Gitah!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:45.72,0:48:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui-chan,
Dialogue: 10,0:48:46.81,0:48:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold onto your stuff.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:49.92,0:48:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How are those, Azu-nyan?
Dialogue: 10,0:48:51.70,0:48:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Those seem okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:53.76,0:48:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 10,0:48:54.62,0:48:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:56.42,0:48:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good to hear.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:57.56,0:48:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They look good on you, Azu-nyan!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:01.26,0:49:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:02.98,0:49:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sushi!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:04.74,0:49:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a conveyor belt type.{sushi on a round conveyor belt}
Dialogue: 10,0:49:06.23,0:49:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It spins?!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:07.38,0:49:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:09.40,0:49:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never been to one, Mugi?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:11.49,0:49:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:12.26,0:49:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, then!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:13.33,0:49:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in London, you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:14.82,0:49:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why we {\i1}should{\i0} go.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:17.57,0:49:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what you can do,
Dialogue: 10,0:49:20.57,0:49:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,London!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:24.71,0:49:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:28.07,0:49:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is this?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:30.13,0:49:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really flashy.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:33.59,0:49:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's spinning!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:35.14,0:49:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's spinning...
Dialogue: 10,0:49:36.86,0:49:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a bad feeling about this...
Dialogue: 10,0:49:38.70,0:49:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it remind you of the baggage claim?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:41.73,0:49:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a little different from what I'd imagined.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:44.65,0:49:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought they'd be spinning like ballerinas.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:48.15,0:49:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a stage{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:49:49.80,0:49:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:51.66,0:49:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the ones from Japan, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:55.40,0:49:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He said "from"...
Dialogue: 10,0:49:57.12,0:49:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and "Japan"...
Dialogue: 10,0:50:00.37,0:50:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:02.24,0:50:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the manager of this establishment.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:05.00,0:50:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the ones who'll be performing today, correct?
Dialogue: 10,0:50:08.21,0:50:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:50:11.42,0:50:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:12.28,0:50:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so tall!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:13.35,0:50:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my sushi bar.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:15.16,0:50:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 10,0:50:17.03,0:50:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't say "yes" to everything.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:19.58,0:50:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's welcoming us.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:22.37,0:50:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, please!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:23.60,0:50:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:30.36,0:50:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is cool!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:31.36,0:50:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you had to wear {\i1}happi{\i0} in sushi restaurants in London!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:34.40,0:50:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's like wearing an apron for a barbecue.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:38.49,0:50:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, if you'd like to get on stage.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:46.34,0:50:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Gitah!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:47.85,0:50:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:49.74,0:50:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:50.90,0:50:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mugi-chan?!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:51.65,0:50:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mugi!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:55.77,0:50:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:01.99,0:51:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Mugi-chan went to tell\N them that we only came to eat.{no, I think she's telling them that they're missing a keyboard...}
Dialogue: 10,0:51:07.21,0:51:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's always nice to have Mugi with us{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:51:10.21,0:51:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind!{KNEW IT}
Dialogue: 10,0:51:15.14,0:51:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly are you doing, Mugi?
Dialogue: 10,0:51:17.02,0:51:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't have a keyboard!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:19.26,0:51:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave this to me!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:21.22,0:51:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, yo!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:22.49,0:51:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I am bucho!{leader}
Dialogue: 10,0:51:22.49,0:51:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fnTahoma\fs54}I'm the leader!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:24.79,0:51:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We are okyaku-san!{customers}
Dialogue: 10,0:51:24.79,0:51:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fnTahoma\fs54}We're just customers!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:27.16,0:51:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ensou shimasen!{We won't play!}
Dialogue: 10,0:51:27.16,0:51:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fnTahoma\fs54}We're not here to play!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:28.98,0:51:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ricchan,
Dialogue: 10,0:51:29.72,0:51:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell you're trying really hard,
Dialogue: 10,0:51:30.70,0:51:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's mostly Japanese!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:32.80,0:51:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You need more English!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:35.42,0:51:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:51:36.60,0:51:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:51:38.13,0:51:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:51:40.06,0:51:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I love sushi.
Dialogue: 10,0:51:42.82,0:51:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,English is too hard.
Dialogue: 10,0:51:45.96,0:51:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ricchan...
Dialogue: 10,0:51:47.35,0:51:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still looking at us...
Dialogue: 10,0:51:49.21,0:51:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we have a choice.
Dialogue: 10,0:51:52.23,0:51:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,W-We'll just have to do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:51:55.66,0:51:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:51:56.71,0:51:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They might not let us have sushi if we don't!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:59.98,0:52:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We really have to play just to eat sushi?!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:03.24,0:52:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do, Yui?
Dialogue: 10,0:52:04.88,0:52:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Which songs?
Dialogue: 10,0:52:07.89,0:52:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:52:10.13,0:52:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:52:16.82,0:52:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Rice After Curry!{curry nochi rice. title plz.}{dunno what we'll do about titles yet}
Dialogue: 10,0:52:18.46,0:52:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,At a sushi restaurant?!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:19.70,0:52:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, they both have rice...
Dialogue: 10,0:52:21.70,0:52:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:23.84,0:52:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 10,0:52:25.09,0:52:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,he looks nice, so...
Dialogue: 10,0:52:26.86,0:52:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:52:36.08,0:52:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:37.46,0:52:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Who're you imitating?
Dialogue: 10,0:52:38.93,0:52:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Please keep us in the loop.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:41.74,0:52:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:43.04,0:52:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I was getting nervous.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:46.80,0:52:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we should hurry.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:50.69,0:52:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Azu-nyan, you're half a half step off.{that's quite a bit off...}
Dialogue: 10,0:52:53.89,0:52:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to tune!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:56.24,0:52:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll match your sound!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:58.38,0:52:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:53:20.45,0:53:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,One,
Dialogue: 10,0:53:20.82,0:53:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,two,
Dialogue: 10,0:53:21.33,0:53:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,one, two, three, four!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:27.14,0:53:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:27.83,0:53:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We're Afterschool Tea Time!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:29.33,0:53:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{SONG HERE}
Dialogue: 10,0:54:32.46,0:54:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:33.45,0:54:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Arigato gozaimashita!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:35.56,0:54:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:36.77,0:54:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a nice one!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:38.23,0:54:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Rice!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:39.57,0:54:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, thank you...
Dialogue: 10,0:54:41.14,0:54:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, could we have some sushi...?
Dialogue: 10,0:54:43.68,0:54:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Love Crisis!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:47.33,0:54:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What did that last guy say?
Dialogue: 10,0:54:51.09,0:54:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He said "Love Crisis."
Dialogue: 10,0:54:55.00,0:54:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard that name before...
Dialogue: 10,0:54:57.64,0:55:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Ricchan's friend's band?
Dialogue: 10,0:55:00.07,0:55:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:02.34,0:55:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Ricchan's friend in Love Crisis Japan, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:55:07.69,0:55:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Spinning things really {\i1}are{\i0} bad omens.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:11.38,0:55:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 10,0:55:13.14,0:55:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still hungry!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:16.43,0:55:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:17.56,0:55:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She had to remind me.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:19.06,0:55:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want...
Dialogue: 10,0:55:21.18,0:55:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,some sushi...
Dialogue: 10,0:55:22.87,0:55:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have the guts to try again.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:27.40,0:55:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if everyone else ate after they performed.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:33.43,0:55:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we get out of the way for now?
Dialogue: 10,0:55:36.36,0:55:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:37.88,0:55:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck was up with that restaurant anyway?
Dialogue: 10,0:55:41.20,0:55:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:42.18,0:55:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ricchan,
Dialogue: 10,0:55:42.81,0:55:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:43.49,0:55:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:55:44.46,0:55:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What a surprise!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:46.00,0:55:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you on vacation?
Dialogue: 10,0:55:47.06,0:55:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:47.93,0:55:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sightseeing!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:49.81,0:55:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You brought everyone with you!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:50.66,0:55:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:53.70,0:55:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, snap!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:54.73,0:55:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm speaking in English!
Dialogue: 10,0:55:56.20,0:55:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They're speaking Japanese...
Dialogue: 10,0:55:59.85,0:56:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Maki-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:01.02,0:56:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Love Crisis Japan!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:03.06,0:56:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:05.33,0:56:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 10,0:56:07.06,0:56:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:10.36,0:56:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:56:11.49,0:56:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We wanted sushi, but the guy told us to play, so we did...
Dialogue: 10,0:56:16.56,0:56:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but we didn't get any sushi...
Dialogue: 10,0:56:18.57,0:56:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We probably weren't good enough.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:20.33,0:56:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 10,0:56:22.08,0:56:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to play here for their opening event.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:26.21,0:56:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they must've mistook us for Love Crisis!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:30.49,0:56:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You solved the mystery!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:31.60,0:56:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my Mugi-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:32.84,0:56:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember Kawakami-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:56:34.86,0:56:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy from the music club?
Dialogue: 10,0:56:36.44,0:56:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:37.12,0:56:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He introduced us to this restaurant.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:39.82,0:56:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows the owner.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:43.83,0:56:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a {\i1}really{\i0} small world.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:46.92,0:56:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This feels weird...
Dialogue: 10,0:56:49.50,0:56:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:50.66,0:56:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The people still think we're you guys!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:52.95,0:56:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:54.42,0:56:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go work it out.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:55.66,0:56:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:56.33,0:56:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:57.12,0:56:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:57.76,0:56:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:59.45,0:57:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so cool...
Dialogue: 10,0:57:02.05,0:57:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:57:06.44,0:57:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We {\i1}finally{\i0} got checked in.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:10.36,0:57:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's finally just the two of us, Azu-nyan...{ｶﾞｯﾊｶﾞﾊｶﾞﾊ(・∀・）ｶﾞｯﾊｶﾞﾊｶﾞﾊ}{ehehhhehehe}
Dialogue: 10,0:57:14.22,0:57:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:15.11,0:57:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a long day.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:16.51,0:57:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry...
Dialogue: 10,0:57:18.62,0:57:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to take a bath...
Dialogue: 10,0:57:20.89,0:57:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 10,0:57:22.01,0:57:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,it was really cold out.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:24.58,0:57:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,0:57:26.25,0:57:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do about dinner?
Dialogue: 10,0:57:31.59,0:57:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We resorted to this, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:57:34.40,0:57:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ui-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:57:36.79,0:57:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll need to thank her later.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:39.09,0:57:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to microwave these, though!
Dialogue: 10,0:57:43.51,0:57:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you guys doing before we came in?
Dialogue: 10,0:57:46.29,0:57:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We were taking pictures.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:48.05,0:57:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,In your uniforms?
Dialogue: 10,0:57:49.06,0:57:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we brought them!
Dialogue: 10,0:57:51.63,0:57:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You get so excited about everything.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:54.04,0:57:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you've put yours on as well...
Dialogue: 10,0:57:57.89,0:57:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That was relaxing.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:59.46,0:58:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ui's so well-prepared...
Dialogue: 10,0:58:02.22,0:58:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my Ui!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:06.56,0:58:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:07.93,0:58:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It just spewed fire...
Dialogue: 10,0:58:09.73,0:58:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:10.55,0:58:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to use a transformer, Yui-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:12.85,0:58:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna...
Dialogue: 10,0:58:14.34,0:58:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too scared now...
Dialogue: 10,0:58:17.24,0:58:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have dinner.
Dialogue: 10,0:58:18.82,0:58:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:58:24.04,0:58:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm repeating a year, Azu-nyan!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:26.16,0:58:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:26.87,0:58:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the same class now!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:29.24,0:58:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:30.04,0:58:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:58:31.56,0:58:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I call you, Yui-senpai?
Dialogue: 10,0:58:34.79,0:58:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I think just "Yui" is fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:58:37.97,0:58:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,"Yui?"
Dialogue: 10,0:58:38.82,0:58:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:58:40.10,0:58:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu... i?
Dialogue: 10,0:58:41.91,0:58:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Louder!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:44.05,0:58:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that, Yui!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:46.13,0:58:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:47.53,0:58:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels strange!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:49.27,0:58:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not an upperclassman anymore!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:53.21,0:58:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...anymore!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:55.17,0:58:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,...anymore...
Dialogue: 10,0:59:14.08,0:59:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What the...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:59:15.85,0:59:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's creepy, Yui-senpai!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:59:23.65,0:59:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodnight.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:02.92,1:01:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Phew, what a relief!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:05.25,1:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:06.32,1:01:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I'd like to see...
Dialogue: 10,1:01:10.39,1:01:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You used it during your play at the festival.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:13.08,1:01:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Ricchan's grave!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:14.79,1:01:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:15.26,1:01:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:16.26,1:01:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The Occult Club made a really accurate replica.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:19.44,1:01:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They love what they do.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:20.55,1:01:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a replica too, you know.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:22.50,1:01:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been walking all day!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:24.53,1:01:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take a break.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:26.21,1:01:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I think there's a place nearby where we can have afternoon tea.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:29.49,1:01:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Afternoon tea?!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:30.93,1:01:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Azu-nyan!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:31.89,1:01:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our heart and soul!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:34.58,1:01:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think we'd need a reservation...
Dialogue: 10,1:01:49.44,1:01:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:51.75,1:01:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's spinning...
Dialogue: 10,1:01:54.87,1:01:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's spinning!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:56.34,1:01:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's ride it!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:58.10,1:01:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mugi-chan!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:59.91,1:02:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mio-chan!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:01.80,1:02:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'll stay here and watch your stuff.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:06.62,1:02:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:07.44,1:02:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Have fun.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:10.18,1:02:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio...
Dialogue: 10,1:02:10.86,1:02:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio-chan...
Dialogue: 10,1:02:11.60,1:02:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be fine!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:13.33,1:02:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:14.21,1:02:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No spinning things!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:16.00,1:02:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:17.27,1:02:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got your back.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:18.58,1:02:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Mio-chan.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:19.86,1:02:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No spinning!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:21.23,1:02:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:23.29,1:02:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see all of London!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:25.09,1:02:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Look at that, Azusa!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:25.82,1:02:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Mio-chan is having fun.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:27.70,1:02:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you can't really tell that you're spinning once you're on it.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:29.05,1:02:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What about that?
Dialogue: 10,1:02:31.29,1:02:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is amazing!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:33.85,1:02:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I should take a picture!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:36.32,1:02:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the Azu-cat out of the bag!{This line is a HUGE problem. This is the literal meaning, but she made a pun: 澪、荷物"あずキャット"くよ！ as opposed to 預かっとくよ. ONEGAI PLEASE MAKE THIS A SUCCESSFUL PUN}
Dialogue: 10,1:02:41.44,1:02:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's lots of people here today!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:43.46,1:02:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Ricchan!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:49.70,1:02:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to Azu-cat-alog our trip with this camera.{same pun here: azu-cat}
Dialogue: 10,1:02:52.64,1:02:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:53.80,1:02:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's spreading!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:57.14,1:02:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:58.19,1:02:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:59.44,1:03:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll sleep with them tonight{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,1:03:00.77,1:03:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is where your bed is!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:15.22,1:03:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:16.16,1:03:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,1:03:17.57,1:03:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But... I... uh...
Dialogue: 10,1:03:19.92,1:03:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not into that kind of stuff!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:22.33,1:03:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 10,1:03:23.99,1:03:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just going to hug Gitah...
Dialogue: 10,1:03:27.84,1:03:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,1:03:30.84,1:03:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, it was a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:32.90,1:03:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:37.02,1:03:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing Ui gave us that self-defense guidebook.
Dialogue: 10,1:03:42.72,1:03:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to bed now, Azu-nyan?
Dialogue: 10,1:03:44.87,1:03:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Want me to...
Dialogue: 10,1:03:47.76,1:03:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,sing you a lullaby?
Dialogue: 10,1:03:51.37,1:03:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{song here}
Dialogue: 10,1:03:53.82,1:03:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 10,1:04:11.24,1:04:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,1:04:11.92,1:04:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't come here to look at pictures!
Dialogue: 10,1:04:15.33,1:04:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Did anyone get any ideas
Dialogue: 10,1:04:16.76,1:04:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,for our song for Azusa-chan?
Dialogue: 10,1:04:19.64,1:04:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 10,1:04:21.85,1:04:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we'd be able to come up with something amazing while in London.
Dialogue: 10,1:04:29.44,1:04:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Ben!
Dialogue: 10,1:04:30.84,1:04:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,London Eye!
Dialogue: 10,1:04:31.90,1:04:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,River Thames!
Dialogue: 10,1:04:33.62,1:04:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,...Or something.
Dialogue: 10,1:04:34.93,1:04:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just shouting out famous monuments.
Dialogue: 10,1:04:38.55,1:04:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We wanted it to be something unlike any of our other songs, right?
Dialogue: 10,1:04:43.03,1:04:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It needs to be something that will get everyone excited even after we graduate!
Dialogue: 10,1:04:48.86,1:04:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Something that will make people feel invincible!
Dialogue: 10,1:04:50.71,1:04:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Invincible...
Dialogue: 10,1:04:57.32,1:04:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 10,1:04:59.98,1:05:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to bring my key with me!
Dialogue: 10,1:05:03.50,1:05:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,1:05:05.59,1:05:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you go through there?
Dialogue: 10,1:05:08.86,1:05:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Huh?
Dialogue: 10,1:05:20.65,1:05:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is a path...
Dialogue: 10,1:05:24.96,1:05:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be returning to Azu-nyan now.
Dialogue: 10,1:05:29.11,1:05:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dropping candies everywhere.
Dialogue: 10,1:05:31.26,1:05:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They're for you!
Dialogue: 10,1:05:32.78,1:05:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Help yourselves.
Dialogue: 10,1:05:34.00,1:05:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodnight, Yui-chan.
Dialogue: 10,1:05:35.27,1:05:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodnight.
Dialogue: 10,1:05:36.62,1:05:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so carefree.
Dialogue: 10,1:05:40.38,1:05:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who it could be!
Dialogue: 10,1:05:42.98,1:05:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too high...
Dialogue: 10,1:05:49.50,1:05:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Azusa's here!
Dialogue: 10,1:05:50.71,1:05:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Azusa!
Dialogue: 10,1:05:51.85,1:05:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 10,1:05:52.78,1:05:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 10,1:05:53.90,1:05:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 10,1:05:55.20,1:05:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Azusa-chan!
Dialogue: 10,1:05:56.55,1:05:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 10,1:06:06.69,1:06:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,1:06:20.49,1:06:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Ricchan!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:22.24,1:06:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:23.51,1:06:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Yui!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:24.70,1:06:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Azu-nyan is gone!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:25.68,1:06:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,She just came over here.
Dialogue: 10,1:06:27.13,1:06:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:27.97,1:06:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,She just went back, though.
Dialogue: 10,1:06:29.19,1:06:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:36.92,1:06:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong, Ritsu-senpai!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:38.53,1:06:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She's awake...
Dialogue: 10,1:06:39.99,1:06:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui-senpai is gone!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:42.63,1:06:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,1:06:45.04,1:06:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ricchan, she's not there!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:46.83,1:06:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do?!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:48.76,1:06:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do, Azu-nyan!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:50.83,1:06:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Azu-nyan is missing!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:53.30,1:06:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you're right here.
Dialogue: 10,1:06:55.12,1:06:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,1:06:56.02,1:06:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 10,1:06:57.64,1:06:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I was worried about you!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:59.10,1:06:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,1:06:59.72,1:07:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 10,1:07:02.54,1:07:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,A phone call!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:03.43,1:07:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,From who?
Dialogue: 10,1:07:04.87,1:07:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it from the front desk?
Dialogue: 10,1:07:06.20,1:07:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This late?
Dialogue: 10,1:07:07.67,1:07:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's from Japan.
Dialogue: 10,1:07:09.28,1:07:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's 6 AM in Japan.
Dialogue: 10,1:07:11.94,1:07:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got your time zones down, Yui-chan.
Dialogue: 10,1:07:16.36,1:07:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,1:07:16.92,1:07:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh,
Dialogue: 10,1:07:17.54,1:07:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,hello?
Dialogue: 10,1:07:18.76,1:07:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:19.78,1:07:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:21.62,1:07:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:22.17,1:07:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A murder?!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:23.70,1:07:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:24.77,1:07:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I got cut off as soon as I picked it up!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:27.50,1:07:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Please be gentle...{ehehehhehEHEHE}{not sure what she said}
Dialogue: 10,1:07:28.01,1:07:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who it was from.
Dialogue: 10,1:07:30.41,1:07:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll call again if it's important.
Dialogue: 10,1:07:33.58,1:07:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,1:07:38.90,1:07:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A song that makes you feel invincible...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:07:47.64,1:07:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I call you, then...?
Dialogue: 10,1:07:51.06,1:07:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Azu-nyan?
Dialogue: 10,1:07:54.95,1:07:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be a dream.
Dialogue: 10,1:08:01.06,1:08:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Senpai,
Dialogue: 10,1:08:02.61,1:08:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,you haven't blinked once.
Dialogue: 10,1:08:05.61,1:08:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A song for Azu-nyan...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:08:08.42,1:08:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Um{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,1:08:09.45,1:08:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Azu-nyan-nyan-nyan...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:08:11.12,1:08:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Azu-nyan-nyan-nyan...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:08:12.33,1:08:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't stare at me!
Dialogue: 10,1:08:15.24,1:08:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 10,1:08:17.37,1:08:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She got mad at me...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:08:20.76,1:08:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't think of any ideas for a song...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:08:25.37,1:08:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Azu-nyan-nyan-nyan,{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:08:26.73,1:08:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Azu-nyan-nyan-nyan...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:08:29.26,1:08:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to get that out of my head.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:08:33.78,1:08:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}London, London...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:08:36.36,1:08:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Recycling only!
Dialogue: 10,1:08:38.46,1:08:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Think!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:08:41.28,1:08:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui-senpai!
Dialogue: 10,1:08:45.02,1:08:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We're leaving soon!
Dialogue: 10,1:08:46.83,1:08:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Azu-nyan!
Dialogue: 10,1:08:49.86,1:08:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 10,1:08:55.11,1:08:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks so Londony!{uh... okay whatevs}
Dialogue: 10,1:08:56.84,1:08:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Yui-senpai's guitar!
Dialogue: 10,1:08:59.36,1:09:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 10,1:09:01.47,1:09:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A song for Azu-nyan...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:09:03.70,1:09:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}An even better...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:09:06.34,1:09:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Better... Better...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:09:08.46,1:09:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bitterer...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:09:10.27,1:09:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stop!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:09:15.96,1:09:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A song for Azu-nyan...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:09:24.32,1:09:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A song that's really cool...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:09:26.36,1:09:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}just like London!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:09:32.09,1:09:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from Kawakami-san.
Dialogue: 10,1:09:37.43,1:09:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard about the sushi bar.{rephrase plz}
Dialogue: 10,1:09:39.06,1:09:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you doing well?
Dialogue: 10,1:09:39.96,1:09:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me talk after!
Dialogue: 10,1:09:42.90,1:09:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard from Maki-chan that you guys are in London too.
Dialogue: 10,1:09:46.73,1:09:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we are.
Dialogue: 10,1:09:47.80,1:09:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted you to do me a favor...
Dialogue: 10,1:09:51.66,1:09:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a show in London that's about Japanese pop culture.
Dialogue: 10,1:09:56.19,1:09:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Both Love Crisis and Black Frill are playing.
Dialogue: 10,1:09:59.70,1:10:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you guys play too, by any chance?
Dialogue: 10,1:10:03.83,1:10:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Popcorn?
Dialogue: 10,1:10:04.90,1:10:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,1:10:06.07,1:10:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's tomorrow afternoon.
Dialogue: 10,1:10:07.29,1:10:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you still be around?
Dialogue: 10,1:10:08.56,1:10:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,1:10:09.59,1:10:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send you a message with the details.
Dialogue: 10,1:10:17.19,1:10:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They want to introduce us as a high school girls' band.
Dialogue: 10,1:10:20.76,1:10:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 10,1:10:22.77,1:10:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,if we got a message from Japan,
Dialogue: 10,1:10:24.79,1:10:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,does that mean it was sent to the past?
Dialogue: 10,1:10:27.55,1:10:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't work like that.
Dialogue: 10,1:10:29.09,1:10:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's today here and tomorrow in Japan, right?
Dialogue: 10,1:10:34.08,1:10:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 10,1:10:35.98,1:10:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 10,1:10:37.57,1:10:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really short notice.
Dialogue: 10,1:10:39.56,1:10:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 10,1:10:40.31,1:10:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That means we're sending messages to the future!
Dialogue: 10,1:10:44.38,1:10:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui-senpai,
Dialogue: 10,1:10:45.62,1:10:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll get us all confused, so please shut up.
Dialogue: 10,1:10:48.90,1:10:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we decline?
Dialogue: 10,1:10:50.87,1:10:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to play.
Dialogue: 10,1:10:54.46,1:10:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not want to?
Dialogue: 10,1:10:55.93,1:10:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I may be wrong,
Dialogue: 10,1:10:57.92,1:10:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but isn't this a great opportunity?
Dialogue: 10,1:10:59.70,1:11:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is different.
Dialogue: 10,1:11:00.71,1:11:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't end up like the sushi restaurant!
Dialogue: 10,1:11:04.22,1:11:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what we're worried about...
Dialogue: 10,1:11:07.17,1:11:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to play, too!
Dialogue: 10,1:11:08.86,1:11:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 10,1:11:10.08,1:11:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 10,1:11:11.05,1:11:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let let Kawakami-san know.
Dialogue: 10,1:11:13.29,1:11:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 10,1:11:22.37,1:11:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Azu-nyan!
Dialogue: 10,1:11:25.90,1:11:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,1:11:29.46,1:11:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Send!
Dialogue: 10,1:11:32.44,1:11:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We sent it to the future!
Dialogue: 10,1:11:35.75,1:11:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,1:11:38.13,1:11:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't we going home tomorrow...?
Dialogue: 10,1:11:40.33,1:11:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 10,1:11:42.05,1:11:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Will we make it to our flight?
Dialogue: 10,1:11:46.38,1:11:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,When was the flight, again?
Dialogue: 10,1:11:48.09,1:11:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be at the airport by 5.
Dialogue: 10,1:11:50.92,1:11:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We start playing at 4 in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 10,1:11:52.88,1:11:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay!
Dialogue: 10,1:11:55.12,1:11:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Definitely!
Dialogue: 10,1:11:56.45,1:11:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a peace sign?
Dialogue: 10,1:11:58.05,1:11:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,1:11:59.34,1:12:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Peace, peace!
Dialogue: 10,1:12:00.64,1:12:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't reassure me in the slightest.
Dialogue: 10,1:12:05.69,1:12:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,First of all, I translated "Rice is a Side Dish."{TITLE CHECK}{gohan wa okazu}
Dialogue: 10,1:12:08.54,1:12:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,1:12:09.27,1:12:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to sing in English?
Dialogue: 10,1:12:10.77,1:12:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to be international!
Dialogue: 10,1:12:12.58,1:12:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 10,1:12:13.74,1:12:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How does it go?
Dialogue: 10,1:12:18.29,1:12:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I translated "rice is awesome"{gohan wa sugoiyo} to "rice is super."
Dialogue: 10,1:12:22.84,1:12:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that too literal?
Dialogue: 10,1:12:24.58,1:12:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What about "nandemo au yo?"{nandemo au yo}
Dialogue: 10,1:12:24.58,1:12:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs54}"it goes with anything"
Dialogue: 10,1:12:26.78,1:12:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,"Bacchiri!"
Dialogue: 10,1:12:26.78,1:12:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs54}"Perfect!"
Dialogue: 10,1:12:27.62,1:12:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,"Just fit!"
Dialogue: 10,1:12:28.93,1:12:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't the first part Japanese?{she said "bacchiri," which is usually written in katakana}
Dialogue: 10,1:12:31.49,1:12:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,"Mushiro gohan ga okazu da yo"
Dialogue: 10,1:12:31.49,1:12:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs54}"You could say rice is the side dish."
Dialogue: 10,1:12:33.59,1:12:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,"Mushiro"...
Dialogue: 10,1:12:33.59,1:12:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\fs54}"You could say"...
Dialogue: 10,1:12:34.78,1:12:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"Not so much A as B."
Dialogue: 10,1:12:37.59,1:12:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a common sentence structure.
Dialogue: 10,1:12:39.64,1:12:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,"Not so much A azu-nyan."
Dialogue: 10,1:12:43.57,1:12:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,"Rice is not so much main dish as side dish?"
Dialogue: 10,1:12:47.92,1:12:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes it sound like rice was the main dish to begin with!
Dialogue: 10,1:12:51.21,1:12:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,1:12:52.06,1:12:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't do that!
Dialogue: 10,1:12:53.52,1:12:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 10,1:12:54.16,1:12:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Next line!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:01.76,1:13:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I just thought of something...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:13:03.53,1:13:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it was for Azu-nyan's song...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:13:05.54,1:13:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't remember it...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:13:07.38,1:13:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It felt like it was something really important...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:13:12.18,1:13:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I call you, then...?
Dialogue: 10,1:13:25.49,1:13:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sleepy, Azu-nyan?
Dialogue: 10,1:13:27.37,1:13:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't sleep well because I was dreaming about you.
Dialogue: 10,1:13:33.18,1:13:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of dream?
Dialogue: 10,1:13:34.49,1:13:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It was {\i1}really{\i0} weird.
Dialogue: 10,1:13:36.93,1:13:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 10,1:13:37.89,1:13:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a secret.
Dialogue: 10,1:13:39.24,1:13:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:41.35,1:13:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:43.60,1:13:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Mugi-chan?
Dialogue: 10,1:13:47.29,1:13:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Mugi-chan!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:49.04,1:13:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that your keyboard?!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:51.68,1:13:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, since you all brought yours...
Dialogue: 10,1:13:54.25,1:13:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You crazy rich people...
Dialogue: 10,1:13:55.88,1:13:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,At least we have everything now!
Dialogue: 10,1:14:13.17,1:14:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks bigger every time I see it.
Dialogue: 10,1:14:15.81,1:14:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like it's spinning faster every time I see it...
Dialogue: 10,1:14:17.57,1:14:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the event!
Dialogue: 10,1:14:31.22,1:14:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way is it?
Dialogue: 10,1:14:32.39,1:14:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They have a yakisoba stall!
Dialogue: 10,1:14:35.10,1:14:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We might get denied again, like at the sushi bar.{she was talking about betting 5000... points? or something}
Dialogue: 10,1:14:40.44,1:14:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Maki-chan!
Dialogue: 10,1:14:44.93,1:14:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ricchan!
Dialogue: 10,1:14:45.78,1:14:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,1:14:47.45,1:14:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,When do you guys start?
Dialogue: 10,1:14:49.53,1:14:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Three thirty.
Dialogue: 10,1:14:51.21,1:14:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're before us.
Dialogue: 10,1:14:53.09,1:14:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Black Frill?
Dialogue: 10,1:14:56.37,1:14:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,1:14:57.03,1:14:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Four?
Dialogue: 10,1:14:57.94,1:15:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't we supposed to go on at four, too?
Dialogue: 10,1:15:00.64,1:15:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think so...
Dialogue: 10,1:15:02.24,1:15:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ricchan, maybe there was a mistake.
Dialogue: 10,1:15:04.38,1:15:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,1:15:05.52,1:15:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's correct.
Dialogue: 10,1:15:08.92,1:15:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We and Black Frill are playing indoors,
Dialogue: 10,1:15:13.00,1:15:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but you guys are playing outdoors.
Dialogue: 10,1:15:16.18,1:15:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Outdoors?
Dialogue: 10,1:15:17.75,1:15:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Not here,
Dialogue: 10,1:15:19.36,1:15:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,but here?
Dialogue: 10,1:15:26.71,1:15:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got a pretty nice view!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:28.60,1:15:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's amazing!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:30.18,1:15:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought we'd play somewhere like this.
Dialogue: 10,1:15:31.92,1:15:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,1:15:32.85,1:15:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a little worried that we were the only ones outside,
Dialogue: 10,1:15:35.82,1:15:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but this isn't too bad!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:36.94,1:15:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 10,1:15:38.54,1:15:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hokago Tea Time?
Dialogue: 10,1:15:40.29,1:15:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:41.73,1:15:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you set up your instruments now, please?
Dialogue: 10,1:15:44.37,1:15:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd he say?
Dialogue: 10,1:15:45.27,1:15:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants us to start setting up.
Dialogue: 10,1:16:11.74,1:16:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it okay to plug this in...?
Dialogue: 10,1:16:14.24,1:16:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,1:16:15.09,1:16:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't spark, will it?
Dialogue: 10,1:16:16.77,1:16:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No, that plug is the same!
Dialogue: 10,1:16:20.34,1:16:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Mio-senpai?
Dialogue: 10,1:16:21.68,1:16:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 10,1:16:23.22,1:16:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This could end very poorly.
Dialogue: 10,1:16:25.33,1:16:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You too?!
Dialogue: 10,1:16:28.97,1:16:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone who knows?
Dialogue: 10,1:16:31.49,1:16:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody in the audience?!
Dialogue: 10,1:16:34.13,1:16:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I could go get a staff member.
Dialogue: 10,1:16:38.17,1:16:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just plug the damn thing in!
Dialogue: 10,1:16:41.04,1:16:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Gitah!
Dialogue: 10,1:16:44.66,1:16:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 10,1:16:49.02,1:16:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sawa-chan?!
Dialogue: 10,1:16:49.97,1:16:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That guitar isn't even Japanese, anyway!
Dialogue: 10,1:16:54.68,1:16:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What the{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,1:16:55.50,1:16:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I seeing things?
Dialogue: 10,1:16:56.70,1:16:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,1:16:58.12,1:16:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You have feet...
Dialogue: 10,1:16:59.16,1:17:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a ghost!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:01.73,1:17:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you in London?
Dialogue: 10,1:17:03.24,1:17:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A honeymoon?
Dialogue: 10,1:17:05.10,1:17:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I had some extra miles saved up.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:08.00,1:17:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I paid for parties with my credit card and had miles saved up,
Dialogue: 10,1:17:11.17,1:17:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but they were going to expire soon.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:13.83,1:17:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm your club advisor!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:16.70,1:17:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you get here?
Dialogue: 10,1:17:17.92,1:17:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I arrived yesterday.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:19.09,1:17:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,When are you going home?
Dialogue: 10,1:17:20.40,1:17:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:21.27,1:17:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Adults sure are amazing...
Dialogue: 10,1:17:22.81,1:17:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You should've told us.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:25.13,1:17:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys didn't pick up when I called you!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:28.44,1:17:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that was you...
Dialogue: 10,1:17:30.96,1:17:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought the perfect outfits for you!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:34.70,1:17:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Japanese lady ninja!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:37.10,1:17:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A {\i1}kunoichi?!{\i0}{female ninja}
Dialogue: 10,1:17:37.98,1:17:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, bravo!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:39.51,1:17:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:40.48,1:17:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't praise her.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:41.73,1:17:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:43.90,1:17:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nodoka-chan!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:45.70,1:17:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ui, too?!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:47.10,1:17:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And Jun!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:48.65,1:17:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Rejected.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:51.58,1:17:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All right,
Dialogue: 10,1:17:52.71,1:17:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,stand by.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:54.04,1:17:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{FUWAFUWA}
Dialogue: 10,1:18:22.04,1:18:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Overall, we enjoyed London very much.
Dialogue: 10,1:18:25.61,1:18:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Very interesting!
Dialogue: 10,1:18:28.49,1:18:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I get that right?
Dialogue: 10,1:18:30.68,1:18:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui, we need to get to the airport.
Dialogue: 10,1:18:33.10,1:18:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 10,1:18:40.57,1:18:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Next is our last song:
Dialogue: 10,1:18:43.35,1:18:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,"Rice is a Side Dish."
Dialogue: 10,1:18:45.67,1:18:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four!
Dialogue: 10,1:18:46.93,1:18:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{SONG}
Dialogue: 10,1:19:03.40,1:19:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After all that...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:19:04.92,1:19:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...she's still singing in Japanese.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:20:20.64,1:20:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,One more!
Dialogue: 10,1:20:27.98,1:20:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're using English {\i1}now?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.19,1:20:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 10,1:20:37.99,1:20:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What the hell...?{\i0}{sawa-chan thought}
Dialogue: 10,1:21:08.65,1:21:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sky high!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:16.09,1:21:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you mean by "sky high"?!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:18.36,1:21:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a bit too excited!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:19.80,1:21:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That baby was too cute!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:22.41,1:21:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree with that, but...
Dialogue: 10,1:21:24.57,1:21:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it the one in front?
Dialogue: 10,1:21:26.72,1:21:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We're barely going to make it!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:28.67,1:21:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to look cool!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:32.06,1:21:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Taxi!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:42.14,1:21:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She passed out.
Dialogue: 10,1:21:43.85,1:21:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Azusa-chan helped us research and plan our entire trip.
Dialogue: 10,1:21:50.61,1:21:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She's probably exhausted.
Dialogue: 10,1:22:09.69,1:22:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's snowing!
Dialogue: 10,1:22:11.77,1:22:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 10,1:22:25.42,1:22:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I just realized something important!
Dialogue: 10,1:22:28.42,1:22:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,1:22:29.22,1:22:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,1:22:34.44,1:22:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We can just be ourselves when we write her song!
Dialogue: 10,1:22:37.66,1:22:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You {\i1}just{\i0} realized that?
Dialogue: 10,1:22:39.66,1:22:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,1:22:40.32,1:22:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I was thinking the exact same thing, Yui-chan.
Dialogue: 10,1:22:42.85,1:22:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mugi-chan?
Dialogue: 10,1:22:44.18,1:22:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've felt that way for a while now.
Dialogue: 10,1:22:46.86,1:22:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 10,1:23:03.77,1:23:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Take whatever you want, Nodoka-chan!
Dialogue: 10,1:23:06.60,1:23:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This'll last you ten years.
Dialogue: 10,1:23:08.95,1:23:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't get a chance to have tea in London.
Dialogue: 10,1:23:12.53,1:23:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 10,1:23:14.14,1:23:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It sucked...
Dialogue: 10,1:23:15.74,1:23:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But you got to perform, right?
Dialogue: 10,1:23:17.94,1:23:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard about that.
Dialogue: 10,1:23:18.74,1:23:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to watch!
Dialogue: 10,1:23:20.26,1:23:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It was so fun!
Dialogue: 10,1:23:21.92,1:23:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole class wanted to watch, you know.
Dialogue: 10,1:23:25.11,1:23:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,1:23:27.13,1:23:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you had a concert in London, right?
Dialogue: 10,1:23:29.99,1:23:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd it go?
Dialogue: 10,1:23:31.19,1:23:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you play?
Dialogue: 10,1:23:32.26,1:23:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"Rice is a Side Dish."
Dialogue: 10,1:23:34.07,1:23:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 10,1:23:35.37,1:23:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Ichigo!{uh? I don't know what the last word was if it isn't her name}
Dialogue: 10,1:23:37.69,1:23:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to hear you guys one more time before we graduate.
Dialogue: 10,1:23:42.30,1:23:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't the jazz workshop having a final concert?
Dialogue: 10,1:23:44.96,1:23:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,1:23:45.52,1:23:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,1:23:46.81,1:23:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea!
Dialogue: 10,1:23:47.90,1:23:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought of that!
Dialogue: 10,1:23:49.46,1:23:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do something!
Dialogue: 10,1:23:50.86,1:23:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,1:23:51.85,1:23:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where should we do it?
Dialogue: 10,1:23:53.22,1:23:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The club room?
Dialogue: 10,1:23:53.96,1:23:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,1:23:55.69,1:23:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I make a request, then?
Dialogue: 10,1:24:00.41,1:24:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A concert in the classroom?
Dialogue: 10,1:24:02.26,1:24:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 10,1:24:03.03,1:24:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,on the last day of school!
Dialogue: 10,1:24:04.85,1:24:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We want to make our last memory in high school a good one!
Dialogue: 10,1:24:07.16,1:24:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That brings back memories!
Dialogue: 10,1:24:09.42,1:24:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We did that{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,1:24:11.59,1:24:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,1:24:12.48,1:24:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll distract the other classes.
Dialogue: 10,1:24:14.80,1:24:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,1:24:15.82,1:24:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Has the choir or wind ensemble ever performed in a classroom?
Dialogue: 10,1:24:19.73,1:24:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's come over you, Sawa-chan?!
Dialogue: 10,1:24:21.75,1:24:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't make you guys an...
Dialogue: 10,1:24:27.42,1:24:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,exception!
Dialogue: 10,1:24:35.90,1:24:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine, Sawa-chan.
Dialogue: 10,1:24:37.43,1:24:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 10,1:24:37.96,1:24:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you understand.
Dialogue: 10,1:24:39.76,1:24:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse us.
Dialogue: 10,1:24:44.28,1:24:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm not sure why,{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:24:45.49,1:24:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I got in pretty deep trouble that time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:24:49.00,1:24:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}These kids are much lighter than we were back then.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:24:53.44,1:24:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're like cute little kids.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:24:55.51,1:24:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They could never take it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:24:57.76,1:24:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They'll definitely cry.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:24:59.99,1:25:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll just have to...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:25:01.51,1:25:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,...back them up!
Dialogue: 10,1:25:05.22,1:25:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Corsages are due tomorrow!
Dialogue: 10,1:25:07.64,1:25:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,1:25:10.02,1:25:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Azusa,
Dialogue: 10,1:25:11.35,1:25:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,could I borrow your scissors?
Dialogue: 10,1:25:13.00,1:25:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,1:25:14.66,1:25:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 10,1:25:15.27,1:25:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,1:25:18.89,1:25:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Azusa...
Dialogue: 10,1:25:20.79,1:25:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 10,1:25:22.34,1:25:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're funny?
Dialogue: 10,1:25:23.91,1:25:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap...
Dialogue: 10,1:25:25.42,1:25:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My club members did{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,1:25:29.40,1:25:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Ui!
Dialogue: 10,1:25:30.91,1:25:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what Azusa did!
Dialogue: 10,1:25:31.99,1:25:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Jun-chan?
Dialogue: 10,1:25:32.95,1:25:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Look at these scissors!
Dialogue: 10,1:25:32.95,1:25:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, it wasn't me...
Dialogue: 10,1:25:38.17,1:25:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 10,1:25:39.67,1:25:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,A concert in the classroom?
Dialogue: 10,1:25:41.51,1:25:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,1:25:42.68,1:25:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in our classroom,
Dialogue: 10,1:25:45.18,1:25:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,so we thought we might play...
Dialogue: 10,1:25:51.50,1:25:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do that.
Dialogue: 10,1:25:53.65,1:25:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be in it, too!
Dialogue: 10,1:25:55.14,1:25:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,1:25:56.46,1:25:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,1:25:58.20,1:26:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the last time I can play for your class,
Dialogue: 10,1:26:01.16,1:26:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and the last time I can play at school, too!
Dialogue: 10,1:26:04.66,1:26:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good to hear!
Dialogue: 10,1:26:05.85,1:26:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Azu-nyan!
Dialogue: 10,1:26:08.45,1:26:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,When are we doing it, Ritsu-senpai?
Dialogue: 10,1:26:17.00,1:26:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's the last day of school!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:26:19.78,1:26:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to protect them!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:26:25.82,1:26:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll need another row.
Dialogue: 10,1:26:28.12,1:26:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we allowed to do that?
Dialogue: 10,1:26:29.36,1:26:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 10,1:26:30.52,1:26:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,we can just clean them later.
Dialogue: 10,1:26:32.14,1:26:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{SONG}
Dialogue: 10,1:26:58.93,1:27:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a once in a lifetime thing!{lit. "we'll have to keep this forever" or something}
Dialogue: 10,1:27:05.96,1:27:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're early, Yamanaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 10,1:27:08.01,1:27:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I've got many things to do.
Dialogue: 10,1:27:11.65,1:27:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,1:27:12.42,1:27:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 10,1:27:14.82,1:27:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe there's some construction going on.
Dialogue: 10,1:27:16.78,1:27:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,1:27:17.81,1:27:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The workers must be having a good time.
Dialogue: 10,1:27:21.54,1:27:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 10,1:27:22.54,1:27:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You were talking about {\i1}this{\i0}, weren't you?!
Dialogue: 10,1:27:24.39,1:27:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew something was fishy!
Dialogue: 10,1:27:25.44,1:27:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Wait!
Dialogue: 10,1:27:27.82,1:27:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A concert?
Dialogue: 10,1:27:28.69,1:27:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,1:27:30.17,1:27:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna watch!
Dialogue: 10,1:27:36.80,1:27:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our last song.
Dialogue: 10,1:27:42.24,1:27:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{SONG 87:45}
Dialogue: 10,1:27:47.80,1:27:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 10,1:27:49.27,1:27:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so cold!
Dialogue: 10,1:27:51.20,1:27:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 10,1:27:52.09,1:27:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 10,1:27:53.29,1:27:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They're starting!
Dialogue: 10,1:28:16.04,1:28:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 10,1:28:18.91,1:28:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No excuses!
Dialogue: 10,1:28:20.41,1:28:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be finished by homeroom!
Dialogue: 10,1:28:54.89,1:28:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A little more...
Dialogue: 10,1:28:58.08,1:28:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Send me a copy later.
Dialogue: 10,1:29:59.56,1:30:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it isn't as bad as when you graduated.
Dialogue: 10,1:31:11.61,1:31:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done!
Dialogue: 10,1:31:12.80,1:31:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is finish Azu-nyan's song!
Dialogue: 10,1:31:15.94,1:31:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but that's always been the biggest problem.
Dialogue: 10,1:31:18.94,1:31:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I wrote the melody!
Dialogue: 10,1:31:21.43,1:31:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me hear it!
Dialogue: 10,1:31:50.50,1:31:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mugi...
Dialogue: 10,1:31:51.43,1:31:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is great!
Dialogue: 10,1:31:54.78,1:31:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we just need to organize the lyrics.
Dialogue: 10,1:31:57.29,1:31:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,1:31:59.68,1:32:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't decide which memories of Azu-nyan we should include.
Dialogue: 10,1:32:03.51,1:32:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's tough.
Dialogue: 10,1:32:04.54,1:32:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She's precious to us!
Dialogue: 10,1:32:06.64,1:32:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put that in!
Dialogue: 10,1:32:11.98,1:32:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 10,1:32:12.97,1:32:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 10,1:32:12.97,1:32:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 10,1:32:27.83,1:32:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinner's ready, sis.{sis might be more natural here}
Dialogue: 10,1:32:32.24,1:32:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,1:32:32.85,1:32:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,1:32:33.83,1:32:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You got taller!
Dialogue: 10,1:32:35.18,1:32:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 10,1:32:54.55,1:32:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 10,1:32:56.39,1:32:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 10,1:32:58.22,1:32:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good!
Dialogue: 10,1:32:59.53,1:33:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 10,1:33:00.90,1:33:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui, I hope you haven't told Azusa{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,1:33:04.56,1:33:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No worries!
Dialogue: 10,1:33:05.83,1:33:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't even told Ui yet!
Dialogue: 10,1:33:08.89,1:33:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 10,1:33:10.92,1:33:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 10,1:33:12.45,1:33:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of the club members...
Dialogue: 10,1:33:15.33,1:33:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,are acting really weird.
Dialogue: 10,1:33:17.02,1:33:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't they just weird...
Dialogue: 10,1:33:18.30,1:33:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,all the time?
Dialogue: 10,1:33:23.21,1:33:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mean it like that.
Dialogue: 10,1:33:25.85,1:33:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's weird, then?
Dialogue: 10,1:33:28.22,1:33:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They stop whatever they were doing when I show up.
Dialogue: 10,1:33:33.49,1:33:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That {\i1}is{\i0} a little odd...
Dialogue: 10,1:33:35.10,1:33:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,When I ask them what they were doing,
Dialogue: 10,1:33:37.59,1:33:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,they just look away.
Dialogue: 10,1:33:39.36,1:33:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're talking to aliens!
Dialogue: 10,1:33:43.08,1:33:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 10,1:33:43.99,1:33:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 10,1:33:45.04,1:33:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,they're hogging all the really good snacks.
Dialogue: 10,1:33:48.71,1:33:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 10,1:33:51.62,1:33:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,possible.
Dialogue: 10,1:33:54.09,1:33:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like they're keeping a secret.
Dialogue: 10,1:33:58.77,1:33:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ui,
Dialogue: 10,1:34:00.17,1:34:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui-senpai isn't...
Dialogue: 10,1:34:02.92,1:34:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,repeating a year, is she?
Dialogue: 10,1:34:06.47,1:34:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No, she isn't.
Dialogue: 10,1:34:07.93,1:34:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 10,1:34:09.18,1:34:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she was going to get new tights for graduation.
Dialogue: 10,1:34:12.15,1:34:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 10,1:34:14.13,1:34:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 10,1:34:15.42,1:34:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,she actually {\i1}didn't{\i0} get into college.
Dialogue: 10,1:34:17.35,1:34:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,1:34:18.29,1:34:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I made sure to check her acceptance letter.
Dialogue: 10,1:34:20.72,1:34:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What could it be, then?
Dialogue: 10,1:34:28.96,1:34:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's nothing, Azusa-chan!
Dialogue: 10,1:34:32.24,1:34:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}demo ne aeta yo suteki na kimi ni{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:34:46.61,1:34:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,These lyrics are missing something...
Dialogue: 10,1:34:54.90,1:34:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming in, Onee-chan!{again, sis}
Dialogue: 10,1:34:57.05,1:34:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in!
Dialogue: 10,1:34:59.19,1:34:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,1:35:01.38,1:35:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, wait!
Dialogue: 10,1:35:07.44,1:35:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, come in!
Dialogue: 10,1:35:15.10,1:35:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to get marks on your face again!
Dialogue: 10,1:35:18.13,1:35:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 10,1:35:20.05,1:35:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go...
Dialogue: 10,1:35:22.94,1:35:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're ready for tomorrow, right?
Dialogue: 10,1:35:25.69,1:35:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,1:35:27.94,1:35:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm finally graduating, huh?
Dialogue: 10,1:35:30.41,1:35:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to bed early, okay?
Dialogue: 10,1:35:31.98,1:35:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You too!
Dialogue: 10,1:35:33.02,1:35:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 10,1:35:35.19,1:35:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ui.
Dialogue: 10,1:35:36.21,1:35:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 10,1:35:39.17,1:35:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,1:35:40.60,1:35:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 10,1:35:42.26,1:35:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to graduate!
Dialogue: 10,1:35:49.58,1:35:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,1:35:52.01,1:35:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Night!
Dialogue: 10,1:35:53.52,1:35:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Night.
Dialogue: 10,1:35:54.98,1:35:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Ui!
Dialogue: 10,1:35:57.86,1:35:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,1:35:58.92,1:36:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We can have tea in college too, right?
Dialogue: 10,1:36:04.79,1:36:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 10,1:36:05.93,1:36:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you can.
Dialogue: 10,1:36:07.58,1:36:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,1:36:08.73,1:36:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 10,1:36:10.77,1:36:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodnight!
Dialogue: 10,1:36:16.01,1:36:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Night.
Dialogue: 10,1:36:31.01,1:36:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}demo ne aeta yo suteki na koneko ni{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:36:52.79,1:36:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 10,1:36:54.01,1:36:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,1:36:55.40,1:36:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 10,1:37:19.83,1:37:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui!
Dialogue: 10,1:37:23.19,1:37:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's open!
Dialogue: 10,1:37:54.88,1:37:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ricchan...
Dialogue: 10,1:37:56.16,1:37:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 10,1:37:57.68,1:37:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think it'll be okay?
Dialogue: 10,1:38:00.54,1:38:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been this nervous before!
Dialogue: 10,1:38:08.34,1:38:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Me neither...
Dialogue: 10,1:38:11.67,1:38:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My hands are really cold!
Dialogue: 10,1:38:15.73,1:38:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right...
Dialogue: 10,1:38:18.93,1:38:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's normal to be nervous!
Dialogue: 10,1:38:23.17,1:38:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 10,1:38:25.37,1:38:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we not do it?
Dialogue: 10,1:38:26.55,1:38:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,1:38:28.12,1:38:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you think Azusa-chan will feel?
Dialogue: 10,1:38:29.89,1:38:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll be happy, of course!
Dialogue: 10,1:38:34.79,1:38:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're all nervous, too!
Dialogue: 10,1:38:38.28,1:38:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course we are!
Dialogue: 10,1:39:17.54,1:39:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I first heard you play "Grant Me Wings,"{Tsubasa wo Kudasai} right?
Dialogue: 10,1:39:24.00,1:39:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That was when you joined the light music club.
Dialogue: 10,1:39:27.59,1:39:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Azusa came,
Dialogue: 10,1:39:29.59,1:39:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and we grew so much!
Dialogue: 10,1:39:32.14,1:39:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Azusa's muting makes the songs so much cleaner.
Dialogue: 10,1:39:35.26,1:39:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yui just uses brute force!
Dialogue: 10,1:39:37.46,1:39:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,As if {\i1}you{\i0} can talk.
Dialogue: 10,1:39:39.44,1:39:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 10,1:39:41.11,1:39:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Azu-nyan granted us wings!{uh... bestowed? fix the previous thing accordingly}
Dialogue: 10,1:39:46.73,1:39:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Azu-nyan is a little, cute angel that brought us happiness!
Dialogue: 10,1:39:52.89,1:39:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,An angel?
Dialogue: 10,1:39:54.00,1:39:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds about right.
Dialogue: 10,1:39:59.66,1:40:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,1:40:02.12,1:40:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{SONG(?)}
Dialogue: 10,1:40:12.82,1:40:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that sound?
Dialogue: 10,1:40:13.99,1:40:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's great!
Dialogue: 10,1:40:15.26,1:40:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a little embarrassing?
Dialogue: 10,1:40:17.14,1:40:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I like it a lot!
Dialogue: 10,1:40:18.92,1:40:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if we can give Azu-nyan wings this time!
Dialogue: 10,1:40:23.83,1:40:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course we can!
Dialogue: 10,1:40:25.33,1:40:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,...I hope.
Dialogue: 10,1:40:26.77,1:40:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We can!
Dialogue: 10,1:40:27.98,1:40:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We put in so many memories of Azusa-chan...
Dialogue: 10,1:40:31.80,1:40:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So many!
Dialogue: 10,1:40:35.36,1:40:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope she likes it.
Dialogue: 10,1:40:41.82,1:40:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we have tea?
Dialogue: 10,1:40:43.46,1:40:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 10,1:40:46.55,1:40:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,1:40:49.30,1:40:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's eat bean paste buns!
Dialogue: 10,1:40:51.19,1:40:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you love these?
Dialogue: 10,1:40:53.48,1:40:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for Azu-nyan.
Dialogue: 10,1:40:57.82,1:40:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How should we start out?
Dialogue: 10,1:41:01.25,1:41:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I, the leader, will say...
Dialogue: 10,1:41:03.33,1:41:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,"Azusa, we'd like to play a song for you."
Dialogue: 10,1:41:07.81,1:41:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Mugi should be next.
Dialogue: 10,1:41:09.28,1:41:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You could say, "We made it for you, Azusa-chan."
Dialogue: 10,1:41:12.29,1:41:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I don't mess it up!
Dialogue: 10,1:41:14.34,1:41:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't smile, Mugi-chan!
Dialogue: 10,1:41:18.46,1:41:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,1:41:20.55,1:41:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever we're talking about this, doesn't{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 10,1:41:24.66,1:41:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Azusa.
Dialogue: 10,1:41:26.77,1:41:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,1:41:28.09,1:41:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,1:41:28.93,1:41:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd prepare the tea this time.
Dialogue: 10,1:41:33.75,1:41:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope!
Dialogue: 10,1:41:45.99,1:41:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, Azu-nyan!
Dialogue: 10,1:41:48.22,1:41:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{SONG 102:15}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.29,1:42:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is why...
Dialogue: 10,1:45:15.76,1:45:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Azu-nyan was happy, right?
Dialogue: 10,1:45:18.36,1:45:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,1:45:19.37,1:45:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,1:45:20.29,1:45:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,1:45:20.90,1:45:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tearing up, Akiyama-san?
Dialogue: 10,1:45:22.46,1:45:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,M-My nose is just running!
Dialogue: 10,1:45:24.97,1:45:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No time to be crying, Mio-chan!
Dialogue: 10,1:45:27.45,1:45:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,1:45:28.31,1:45:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in college now!
Dialogue: 10,1:45:30.47,1:45:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are so optimistic!
Dialogue: 10,1:45:32.96,1:45:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to prepare some more mature snacks with our tea!
Dialogue: 10,1:45:36.73,1:45:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 10,1:45:37.62,1:45:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going that far?
Dialogue: 10,1:45:40.48,1:45:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're done crying.
Dialogue: 10,1:45:42.13,1:45:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that song by Death Devil was for an underclassman, too.
Dialogue: 10,1:45:46.86,1:45:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,1:45:47.98,1:45:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,People have different ways of expressing themselves, huh?
Dialogue: 10,1:45:50.90,1:45:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,1:45:51.80,1:45:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We kept up the tradition!
Dialogue: 10,1:45:54.94,1:45:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just a coincidence, though.
Dialogue: 10,1:45:59.19,1:46:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where should we go next year?
Dialogue: 10,1:46:01.64,1:46:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Next year?
Dialogue: 10,1:46:03.04,1:46:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,For Azu-nyan's graduation trip!
